  <para style="h">Nehimaiya</para>
  <para style="toc1">Nehimaiya</para>
  <para style="toc2">Nehimaiya</para>
  <para style="toc3">Neh</para>
  <para style="mt1">Nehimaiya</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="NEH 1" />
  <para style="s1">Akam Nehimaiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 1:1" />Mme ikọ Nehimaiya ayịn Hakalia:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="NEH 1:1" />
  <para style="b" vid="NEH 1:1" />
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 1:1">Ke afiọñ Kislef ke ayọhọ isua edịb, ke ini a-ami ñkebaaha ke ufọk adidem ke Susa, <verse eid="NEH 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 1:2" />Hanani, ayịneka mmi awodeen keed, amaato Yuda adi ye mbon mfen, ndin ami mmaabịp ammọ mbaña mme ñyọhọnsʌhọ nditọ Yuu e-ekebọkkọke ntañnsio, ñnyʌñ mbịp mbaña Yeruselem.<verse eid="NEH 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 1:3" />Ammọ emaembo miin ete, “Mbon se ikibọkkọ ntañnsio inyʌñ itịmme inyọñ abio eba ke ekamba ukuud ye asuenne. Ndibene Yeruselem awuudo, enyʌñ efọp inuaatob amọ ke ikañ.”<verse eid="NEH 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 1:4" />Ke ini ami ñkekoppo mme ñkpọ ami, ami mmaasuuk ntie ntua. Ke ñkpọ nte usen ifañ ami mmaafʌhọ, ntie utreudia ñnyʌñ mbọñ akam ke iso Abasi anyọñ. <verse eid="NEH 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 1:5" />Ndin ami mmaabo nte:</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="NEH 1:5">“<char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi ke hefịn, ekamba ye anie uteeñe Abasi, ake anịmme edioomo ima amọ ye mbon se ima anye inyʌñ inịm mme mbed amọ, <verse eid="NEH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 1:6" />kpañ utọñ nyʌñ tat anyen mfo mbaak akop akam ake awo utom mfo abọññọ ke iso mfo uweemeayio ye akonayio abaña ikọd mfo, nditọ Isrel. Ami mmeyaara mme idiọọkñkpọ ñnyịn nditọ Isrel, kpa ye ake mmi ye ufọk ete mmi, inamma udue fiin. <verse eid="NEH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 1:7" />Ñnyịn iminam abʌd-abʌd ido ye afo. Ñnyịn inyʌññọ inịm mme mbed, ewʌhọ ye item a-afo akenọọhọ isʌñutom mfo Moses.<verse eid="NEH 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 1:8" />“Toiyo ikọ a-afo akedọkkọke isʌñutom mfo Moses, abo, ‘Ndufo emaenam idiọọk ido, ami ñyaisuan ndufo ke atu mme idịd, <verse eid="NEH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 1:9" />ado ndufo imaitịmme iñkeene miin inyʌñ inịm mme mbed mmi, mbon ndufo ekpesuana ewuọ utịd anyọñ, ami ñyaakoono ammọ ke udo ñnyʌñ mben ammọ ndi itie ake ami mmekke nte itie idʌñ nnọ Anyịñ mmi.’<verse eid="NEH 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 1:10" />“Ammọ edo mme mbon utom mfo ye mme ikọd mfo, ake afo akefakka ke akwa adudu ye ke akpọsọñ ubọk mfo. <verse eid="NEH 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 1:11" /><char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, kpañ utọñ nọ akam isʌñutom mfo ami ye akam mme isʌñutom mfo se ima aditeeñe anyịñ mfo. Nọ isʌñutom mfo mfọniso mfịn ami ke adinam anye akịt mfọn ke iso adidem.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 1:11">Ami ñkedo andisitọkkọ ukọd nsịn ke kọọb nnọọ adidem nọ anwọñ.<verse eid="NEH 1:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="NEH 2" />
  <para style="s1">Ataseeses Adọñ Nehimaiya Aka Yeruselem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 2:1" />Ke afiọñ Nisan ke ayọhọ isua edịb tọọñọ Ataseeses akedo Adidem, ke ini emaekeben ukọd esọk anye, ami mmaaben ukọd ñnyʌñ ñkenọ adidem. Kpaanaanam mfʌhọke ke iso adidem akpa, <verse eid="NEH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 2:2" />anam adidem amambịp miin ate, “Nsoo inam nọ iso mfo aba mfʌhọ-mfʌhọ ntoro ke ini afo umuudọñọkedọñọ? Ami ikemeke ido ñkpọ mfen ikan mfʌhọ esịd.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 2:2">Ndịk amannam eti-eti, <verse eid="NEH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 2:3" />ado ami mmaabo adidem nte, “Yak adidem adu uwem ke nsi-nsi! Die ke iso mmi imiikpibaaha mfʌhọ-mfʌhọ ke ini abio e-ebuuhọ mme eteete mmi adooho ñwuudo, ndin mme inuaatob amọ emaesịn ikañ?”<verse eid="NEH 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 2:4" />Adidem amambo miin ate, “Nsoo ke afo ayem?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 2:4">Ndin ami mmaabọñ akam ñkoot Abasi anyọñ, <verse eid="NEH 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 2:5" />ñnyʌñ mbọọrọ adidem nte, “Adieke anemme adidem esịd, ñko akpedo isʌñutom mfo a-akịt mfọn ke iso amọ, yak anye andọñ miin nọ ñka abio Yuda e-ebuuhọ mme eteete mmi nọ ñkemaana mbọp abio ado.”<verse eid="NEH 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 2:6" />Ndin adidem, ye abọọñanwaan ke ñkañ amọ atie, amambịp miin ate, “Isañ mfo adiikpeene die, uduunyʌñ unyọñ udi idaha akee?” Amaanem adidem esịd adinnọ miin ñka; anam ami mmaanịm ini.<verse eid="NEH 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 2:7" />Ami ñko ñnyʌñ ndian mbo anye nte, “Ke adidem amaaha, yak anye annọ ñwed nsọk mme adaukara ke Inyañ Yufretis Edem uko, nọ ammọ endat usʌñ tutu ñkewuọ Yuda ke ifuuro. <verse eid="NEH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 2:8" />Ñko yak anye annọ ñwed nsọk Asaf, andikpeme akai adidem, nọ anye annọ eto nọ edat enam atekke enọ mme inuaatob, ye ake ndibene abio ye ake ufọk ake ami ndiidʌñ.” Ndin sia adifọn ubọk Abasi mmi amaakendoro miin ke idem, adidem amaanam se ami ñkebeeñe. <verse eid="NEH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 2:9" />Ndin ami mmaakaa mbịne mme adaukara ke Edem-Yufretis ñnyʌñ ñkenọ ammọ mme ñwedetob adidem. Adidem amaanyʌñ anọ mme etubom mbon ekọñ ye kafalri esaña ye ami.<verse eid="NEH 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 2:10" />Ke ini Sanbalad awo Họrọn ye Tobia awo ke atu mme adaaha Amọn akekoppo ñkpọ ami, amaafịna ammọ eti-eti naña awo akpediyem ufọn nditọ Isrel.<verse eid="NEH 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nehimaiya Ase mme Ndibene Yeruselem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 2:11" />Ami mmaakaa Yeruselem, ndin ke mmaakeba do usen ita <verse eid="NEH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 2:12" />mmaadakka isañ akonayio ye ibad-ibad awo. Ami ñkidọkkọke awo ndomokeed se Abasi mmi akensịn miin ke esịd adinam nnọọ Yeruselem. Mme enañuwad ndomokeed ikibaaha ye ami ke amaaboiyo anye ake ami ñkewatta.<verse eid="NEH 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 2:13" />Ke akonayio ami mmaasaña Inuaatob Abedeñ ñwuọ ñkaa Ube Mmọọñ Yakal ye Inuaatob Ifịm, ñkeseet mme ndibene Yeruselem e-emaekewuut, ye mme inuaatob amọ, i-ikañ amaaketa. <verse eid="NEH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 2:14" />Ndin ami mmaaboiyo ñkewuọ Inuaatob Faunten ye Ñkpọdiọhọ Mmọọñ Adidem, ado ufañ ikikponno ikem se enañuwad mmi asaña aboiyo; <verse eid="NEH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 2:15" />anam ami mmaadọọk ndʌk abedeñ akonayio, nseet ndibene. Ke akpatre, ami mmaatịmme ndisaña Inuaatob Abedeñ ñnyọñ. <verse eid="NEH 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 2:16" />Mme adaaha ikidiọọñọke nte ami ñkekaa me se ami ñkenam, sia idaha ado ami ñketañña ñkpọ ndomokeed diin nnọ mme Yuu me mme aku me mme mbọọñ me mme adaaha me mbon mfen se idiinam utom ado.<verse eid="NEH 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 2:17" />Ndin ami mmaabo ammọ nte, “Ndufo emekịt mfịna se ñnyịn idʌk: Yeruselem akappa ndoon, ndin mme inuaatob amọ eta ikañ. Edi, yak ñnyịn imaana idiọñ ndibene Yeruselem, mbaak ñnyịn idika iso ido ñkpọ ndọk.” <verse eid="NEH 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 2:18" />Ami mmaanyʌñ ndọkkọ ammọ naña ubọk Abasi andoro ke idem ye se adidem akembo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 2:18">Ammọ emaebọọrọ ete, “Yak itọọñọ adimaana mbọp.” Ndin ammọ emaetọọñọ eti utom ami.<verse eid="NEH 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 2:19" />Ado ke ini Sanbalad awo Họrọn, Tobia adaaha mbon Amọn ye Kesem awo Arab ekekoppo ebaña ñkpọ ami, ammọ emaesaha enyʌñ eduọi ñnyịn. Ammọ emaebịp ebo, “Nsoo ke ndufo enam ami? Ndufo esọñ iwuod ye adidem?”<verse eid="NEH 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 2:20" />Ami mmaabọọrọ ammọ nte, “Abasi anyọñ ayainọ ñnyịn mfọn. Ñnyịn mbon utom amọ iyaitọọñọ adimaana mbọp, ado amaado ndufo, ndufo inieghe udeeme ke Yeruselem me unen ke ñkpọ ndomokeed se ibaña anye.”<verse eid="NEH 2:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="NEH 3" />
  <para style="s1">Mme Andibọb Ndibene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 3:1" />Eliasịb ekamba aku ye mme emọemọ aku mfen emaedaaña ekaa utom enyʌñ ekebọp Inuaatob Edọñ. Ammọ emaenịm anye ke adisana enyʌñ edọọñ mme udọk, enyʌñ ebọp tutu akewuọ Tọwa Ikie, ake ammọ ekenịmme ke adisana, tutu akewuọ Tọwa Hananel. <verse eid="NEH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 3:2" />Mbon Yeriko emaebọp ediana do, ndin Saku ayịn Imri amaabọp adiana ammọ.<verse eid="NEH 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 3:3" />Nditọ ideen Hasenaa ekebọp Inuaatob Iyak. Ammọ emaebono mme abom amọ enyʌñ edọọñ mme udọk ye mme etəñ ye ufiọk amọ ke itie. <verse eid="NEH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 3:4" />Meremọd ayịn Yuria, ayịn Hakos, akediọñ ikpeghe a-adianake ammọ. Adakka do, Mesulam ayịn Berekia, ayịn Mesesabel, akediọñ adiana ammọ, ndin Sadọk ayịn Baana anyʌñ adiọñ adiana ammọ. <verse eid="NEH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 3:5" />Ado mbon abio Tekoa ekediọñ mbakka a-akedianake, ado mme mbọọñ ammọ ikisịnne idem ke utom ado ke idak ndadusʌñ ammọ.<verse eid="NEH 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 3:6" />Yoiyada ayịn Pasei ye Mesulam ayịn Besodeiya ekediọñ Inuaatob Yesana. Ammọ emaebon abom amọ enyʌñ edọñ udọk ye mme etəñ ye ufiọk ammọ ke itie. <verse eid="NEH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 3:7" />Ke udiana, mbon Kibiọn ye Mispa, Melatia awo Kibiọn ye Yadọn awo Meronọd, emaediọñ mme itie ke idak adaukara ke Edem-Yufretis. <verse eid="NEH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 3:8" />Usiel ayịn Hahaiya, keed ke atu mme anamusọ kold, amaadiọñ adiana anye; ndin Hananaiya, keed ke atu mbon unam pefium, amaanyʌñ adiọñ itie adiana do. Ammọ emaediọñ Yeruselem tutu akewuọ Ñnwaña Ndibene. <verse eid="NEH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 3:9" />Refaiya ayịn Họọ, andikara ubaak Yeruselem, amaadiọñ adiana ammọ. <verse eid="NEH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 3:10" />Yedaiya ayịn Harumaf amaadiọñ itie akesakka iso ase ufọk amọ akpere do, ndin Hatus ayịn Hasabneiya amaanyʌñ adiọñ itie akpere anye. <verse eid="NEH 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 3:11" />Malkiya ayịn Harim ye Hasub ayịn Pahad-Moab emaediọñ itie mfen ye Tọwa mme Ofen. <verse eid="NEH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 3:12" />Salum ayịn Halohes, andikara ubaak Yeruselem, ye nditọ ibaan amọ emaediọñ itie se ikidiana ndo.<verse eid="NEH 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 3:13" />Hanun ye mme andidʌñ ke Sanoa ekediọñ Inuaatob Abedeñ. Ammọ emaebọp anye enyʌñ edọñ mme udọk ye mme etəñ ye ufiọk ammọ ke itie. Ammọ emaenyʌñ ediọñ ndibene ado ke unyọọñ kubid tọsịn keed<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A-adooho ñkpọ nte ikpad 1,500 me ñkpọ nte mita 450</char></note> tutu akewuọ Inuaatob Ifịm.<verse eid="NEH 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 3:14" />Malkiya ayịn Rekab, andikara ke efaak Bed Hakerem, akediọñ Inuaatob Ifịm. Anye amaamaana abọp anye anyʌñ adọñ mme udọk ye mme etəñ ye ufiọk ammọ ke itie.<verse eid="NEH 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 3:15" />Salum ayịn Kol-Hose, andikara efaak Mispa akediọñ Inuaatob Idịm Mmọọñ. Anye amaabọp anye, ayat akọm anyʌñ adọñ mme udọk ye mme etəñ ye ufiọk ke itie ammọ. Anye amaanyʌñ adiọñ ndibene ñkpọdiọhọ mmọọñ Siloam, a-adianake Inwañesa Adidem, tutu akewuọ udodukod a-asọiyọke ato Abio Defid. <verse eid="NEH 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 3:16" />Akeboiyo ndo, Nehimaiya ayịn Asbuk, andikara ubaak Bed Sọọ, amaadiọñ akewuọ ke nsakiso udi Defid, tutu ke ñkpọdiọhọ mmọọñ e-ekenamma ye Ufọk Mbon Uko.<verse eid="NEH 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 3:17" />Ndin mme Lifai ke idak Rehum ayịn Bani emaediọñ ediana anye. Hasabaiya, andikara ubaak Keila, amaadiọñ ñkañ idʌñ amọ adiana anye. <verse eid="NEH 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 3:18" />Mme Lifai mfen ke idak Binui ayịn Henadad, andikara ubaak Keila mbeñ uko, emaediọñ ediana anye. <verse eid="NEH 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 3:19" />Esaa ayịn Yesua, andikara Mispa amaanyʌñ adiọñ itie mfen adiana anye, tọọñọ ke nsakiso ndọọkndʌk itie ubono ñkpọ ekọñ tutu akewuọ ñkpitʌñ ndibene. <verse eid="NEH 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 3:20" />Baruk ayịn Sabai amaasịn ifịk aben tọọñọ ke ñkpitʌñ ado akewuọ inuausʌñ ufọk ekamba aku Eliasịb. <verse eid="NEH 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 3:21" />Meremọd ayịn Yuria, ayịn Hakos, amaadiọñ adiana anye tọọñọ ke inuausʌñ ufọk Eliasịb tutu akewuọ utịd ufọk ado.<verse eid="NEH 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 3:22" />Mme aku ke ñkanñkʌk idʌñ ado emaediọñ ediana anye. <verse eid="NEH 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 3:23" />Ke aboiyoke ammọ, Benyamin ye Hasub emaediọñ iso ufọk ammọ; ndin Asaria ayịn Maaseiya, ayịn Anania amaadiọñ mben ufọk amọ adiana ammọ. <verse eid="NEH 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 3:24" />Binui ayịn Henadad amaadiọñ itie mfen adiana anye, tọọñọ ke ufọk Asaria tutu akewuọ ñkpitʌñ ndibene ye inuuk, <verse eid="NEH 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 3:25" />ndin Palal ayịn Usai amaanam ñkpitʌñ ndibene ye tọwa a-akewuọhọ akem ye ufọk anyọñ adidem, a-akekpereke afe mbon ukpeme. Pedaiya ayịn Paros <verse eid="NEH 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 3:26" />ye mme anamutom ke tembịd e-edʌññọ ke abod Ofel emaediọñ ediana anye tutu akewuọ nsakiso Inuaatob Mmọọñ a-aseeghe edem usakkautịn ye tọwa a-awuọhọ ada. <verse eid="NEH 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 3:27" />Mbon Tekoa emaediọñ ubaak itie ediana ammọ, tọọñọ ke ekamba tọwa a-awuọhọ ada tutu asịm ndibene Ofel.<verse eid="NEH 3:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 3:28" />Ke ñkañ anyọñ Inuaatob Enañmbakara, mme aku emaediọñ iso ufọk ammọ keedekeed. <verse eid="NEH 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 3:29" />Sadọk ayịn Imma amaadiọñ adiana ammọ ke nsakiso ufọk amọ. Semaiya ayịn Sekanaiya, andikpeme Inuaatob Edem Usakkautịn amaadiọñ adiana anye. <verse eid="NEH 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 3:30" />Hananaiya ayịn Selemia, ye Hanun, ayọhọ ayịn Salaf itiokeed, emaediọñ efaak mfen ediana anye. Mesulam ayịn Berekia amaadiana anye, amaadiọñ nsakiso itie idʌñ amọ. <verse eid="NEH 3:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 3:31" />Malkiya, keed ke atu mme anam usọ ke kold, amaadiana anye, adiọñ tutu akewuọ ufọk mme anamutom ke tembịd ye ake mme anyamudua, ke nsakiso Inuaatob Ukpeme, tutu akewuọ ubeed ke anyọñ inuuk; <verse eid="NEH 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NEH 3:32" />ndin mme anamusọ ye mme anyamudua emaediọñ tọọñọ ke ubeed ado tutu akewuọ Inuaatob Edọñ.<verse eid="NEH 3:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="NEH 4" />
  <para style="s1">Ubiọñọ ke Adimaana Mbọp</para>
  <para style="p">
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">4: </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Ke ikpañwed Hibru Neh 4:1-6 ewet Neh 3:33-38, ñko Neh 4:7-23 ewet Neh 4:1-17</char>
    </note> <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 4:1" />Ke ini Sanbalad akekoppo ke ñnyịn ikisʌk idiọñ ndibene, anye amaayat esịd anyʌñ akop ataa ifiobesịd. Anye amaasak mme Yuu, <verse eid="NEH 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 4:2" />ndin ke iso mme nsaña amọ ye mbon ekọñ Sameria, anye amaabo, “Nsoo ke mme ñyeeme Yuu ado enanam? Ammọ eyaemaana ibọp ndibene ammọ? Ammọ eyaewa mme uwa? Ammọ eyaekweeñe ke usen keed? Nte ammọ ekeme edimaana ndemme uwem mme itiad ado nsịññe ke ñwuudo ado, ke naña ikañ aketa ammọ?”<verse eid="NEH 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 4:3" />Tobia awo Amọn, a-akesañake ke ñkañ amọ, amaabo, “Nsoo ke ammọ ebọbọp; akpekọm ewaikọd adọọk ndibene itiad ammọ ado akeme adiwuut anye!”<verse eid="NEH 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 4:4" />Kpañ utọñ inọ ñnyịn, Abasi ñnyịn, sia e-esịn ñnyịn ke ndek. Nam nsueñ ammọ atịmme akedoro ammọ ke iwuod. Yaak ammọ nọ nte ñkpọ mbịme ke isọñ ufʌn. <verse eid="NEH 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 4:5" />Kuufʌk mme ukwaññkpọ ammọ, kuunyʌñ ukwokko mme idiọọkñkpọ ammọ ke iso mfo ufep, sia ammọ enọ mme anamutom usọñanyen.<verse eid="NEH 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 4:6" />Ntom ke ñnyịn ikimaana ibọp ndibene tutu afịd itie awuọ mbakka iba unyọọñ amọ, sia mme awo ekenam utom ke afịd esịd ammọ.<verse eid="NEH 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 4:7" />Ado ke ini Sanbalad, Tobia, mbon Arab, mbon Amọn ye mbon Asdọd ekekoppo ke esʌk ekaiso ediọñ ndibene Yeruselem, ñko ke esʌk esiit mme ufañ se ikinaa, ammọ emaeyat esịd eti-eti. <verse eid="NEH 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 4:8" />Afịd ammọ emaedioomo adikinwana ye Yeruselem ñnyʌñ nsịn ntịme do. <verse eid="NEH 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 4:9" />Ado ñnyịn imaibọñ akam inọ Abasi ñnyịn inyʌñ inịm awoukpeme uweemeayio ye akonayio mbaak ammọ edinam ibak.<verse eid="NEH 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 4:10" />Ke ini ado, mbon Yuda emaebo ete, “Udịd asʌk akweeñe mme anamutom, ndin ñwuudo ndibene asʌk akpon se isʌhọ se ñnyịn imiikanna ibọp.”<verse eid="NEH 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 4:11" />Ñko mme asua ñnyịn emaebo ete, “Mbemiso ammọ edọọdiọọñọ me ekekịt ñnyịn, ñnyịn iyaiba do ke atu ammọ inyʌñ iwot ammọ inyʌñ inam utom ado atre.”<verse eid="NEH 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 4:12" />Akem mme Yuu e-ekedʌññọ ediana ammọ edibo ñnyịn akañ duob ete, “Nte ndufo ekakanna ekaa, ammọ eyainwana ñnyịn.”<verse eid="NEH 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 4:13" />Ke ntoro ami mmaanịm mme awo ke edem usuuk-usuuk itie ke ndibene, ke mme itie se ekeme edikịt awo, nnịm ammọ ke ubon ke ubon, ekama akañkañ ammọ, ye eduad ammọ ye utịgha ammọ. <verse eid="NEH 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 4:14" />Ke ami mmaakese naña ñkpọ aba, ami mmaadakka nda ñnyʌñ mbo mme mbọọñ, mme adaaha ye afịd mbon awo nte, “Ikiibaak ammọ. Itoiyo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, a-akponno anyʌñ anie uteeñe, ndin inwana ekọñ inọ mme ubon ndufo, nditọ ideen ye nditọ ibaan ndufo, ibaan ndọ ye mme ufọk ndufo.”<verse eid="NEH 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 4:15" />Ke ini mme asua ñnyịn ekekoppo ke ñnyịn imidiọọñọ se ammọ eduak ñko ke Abasi abiat uduak ammọ, afịd ñnyịn imaitịmme ika ndibene, ikinam utom ñnyịn.<verse eid="NEH 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 4:16" />Tọọñọ ke usen ado, mbakka ideen mmi keed ke itie iba ekenam utom, ke ini mbakka keed ako ekekamake mme eduad, atuekọñ, utịgha ye mme afọñidem ekọñ. Mme ikpọawo ekọñ emaenyʌñ eda ke edem afịd ufọk Yuda <verse eid="NEH 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 4:17" />e-ekebọppọ ndibene. Mbon ekekoonoke ñkpọ utom ekenam utom ammọ ubọk keed enyʌñ ekama ñkpọ ekọñ ke ubọk uko <verse eid="NEH 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 4:18" />ndin mme abọbufọk keedekeed emaebọbọ akañkañ ammọ ke isịn naña ammọ ekenamma utom. Ado awo a-akefịtte adukpoñ akeba ye ami.<verse eid="NEH 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 4:19" />Ndin ami mmaabo mme mbọọñ, mme adaaha ye afịd mbon awo nte, “Utom ami akpon anyʌñ atara eti-eti, ñko ñnyịn iminyʌñ inyọọñ usʌñ ikpọñ emọ-emọ ke ndibene. <verse eid="NEH 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 4:20" />Itie akeedodo ake ndufo ediikop uyio adukpoñ, isoobo ñnyịn do. Abasi ñnyịn ayaanwana ekọñ inọ ñnyịn!”<verse eid="NEH 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 4:21" />Ntom ke ñnyịn ikikaa iso inam utom, mbakka ideen keed ke itie iba ekama eduad, tọọñọ ke usiere tutu mme ntantaafiọñ ewuọñọ. <verse eid="NEH 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 4:22" />Ke ini ado ami mmaanyʌñ mbo afịd awo nte, “Yak afịd awo ye mme andinwam ammọ eba ke Yeruselem akonayio, mbaak ammọ ikpeme ñnyịn akonayio enyʌñ enam utom uweemeayio.” <verse eid="NEH 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 4:23" />Ndin ami me nditọete mmi me ideen mmi me mbon ukpeme e-ekebaaha ye ami ndomokeed ikisịññeke afọñidem ñnyịn ke idem; afịd awo ekekaakama ñkpọ ekọñ, idem idaha e-eyemme adikibọ mmọọñ.<verse eid="NEH 4:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="NEH 5" />
  <para style="s1">Nehimaiya Anyaaña Mbon Uweene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 5:1" />Akema mme awo ye mme ibaan ammọ eseeme akpọsọñ-akpọsọñ ebaña mme Yuu nditọete ammọ. <verse eid="NEH 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 5:2" />Usʌk ammọ ete, “Ñnyịn ye nditọ ideen ye nditọ ibaan ñnyịn imiwak; mbaak ato do ñnyịn idu uwem, ana ñnyịn inie abakpa.”<verse eid="NEH 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 5:3" />Usʌk mfen ekesʌk ebo ete, “Ñnyịn imiben mme inwañ ñnyịn, mme inwañ fain ñnyịn ye mme ufọk ñnyịn inịm ubiọñ nọ ato do ñnyịn inie abakpa ke ini akañ.”<verse eid="NEH 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 5:4" />Kpa usʌk mfen ekesʌk ebo ete, “Akena iwọwuọt akʌk ikpe ataksi inọ adidem ke mme inwañ ye mme inwañ fain ñnyịn. <verse eid="NEH 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 5:5" />Akpesʌkado ñnyịn ido abʌk ye iyiib keed nte mme Yuu nditọete ñnyịn ñko akpesʌkado nditọ ñnyịn enyʌññọ efọn nte ake ammọ, kpayeado ñnyịn iminam nditọ ideen ye nditọ ibaan ñnyịn ekappa edoñño mme ifʌn. Ubaak nditọ ibaan ñnyịn emaedodo ifʌn, ado ñnyịn inieghe se ikan inam, sia mme inwañ ye mme inwañ fain ñnyịn enie mbon mfen.”<verse eid="NEH 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 5:6" />Ke ini ami mmaakekop ñkpoyo ammọ ye mme ikọ se eketañ edian, esịd amañyat eti-eti. <verse eid="NEH 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 5:7" />Ami mmaakere mme ñkpọ ami ke esịd mmi ndin mmaatọhọ ye mme mbọọñ ye mme adaaha. Ami mmaabo ammọ nte, “Ndufo ebọ mbon ndufo udod!” Ndin mmaakoot ataa uwak awo mbok nọ ato do eneme ebaña ñkpọ ami <verse eid="NEH 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 5:8" />ñnyʌñ mbo: “Ke naña ikpikakan, ñnyịn imaifak nditọ Yuu ñnyịn ake ekenyamma enọ mme Gentile isio. Idahami ndufo enyaanyam mbon ndufo, nọ emaana eben ammọ enyam inọ ñnyịn!” Ammọ emaedop uyio, sia ammọ ikinieghe se etañ.<verse eid="NEH 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 5:9" />Ndin ami mmaakaiso ntañ mbo, “Se ndufo enam ifọnnọ. Nte ndufo ikpisañake ke mbaak Abasi ñnyịn nọ ato do etre esaha mme Gentile asua ñnyịn? <verse eid="NEH 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 5:10" />Ami ye mme nditọete mmi ye mme ikọd mmi isʌk iwuọt mbon awo akʌk ye ñkpasi abakpa ñko. Ado yak itre adibọ udod! <verse eid="NEH 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 5:11" />Ndufo iyaak usọp-usọp mme inwañ ammọ, mme inwañ fain, mme inwañ ọlif ye mme ufọk ammọ inọ ammọ, ñko ye udod ake ndufo ebọọhọ ammọ, mbaak keed ke itie ikie (100) ke akʌk, ñkpasi abakpa, ufa ukọd ye adan ọlif.”<verse eid="NEH 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 5:12" />Ammọ emaebo ete, “Ñnyịn iyaikpọñ inọ ammọ. Ñko ñnyịn idiibọọhọ ammọ ñkpọ aba. Ñnyịn iyainam naña afo abo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 5:12">Ndin ami mmaakoot mme aku ñnyʌñ nnam mme mbọọñ ye mme adaaha edat unwọñọ ebo ke mmimọ iyainam naña ikinwọñọ ado. <verse eid="NEH 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 5:13" />Ami mmaanyʌñ ñnyeghe ikpanesịd afọñ mmi nsio ñnyʌñ mbo, “Ntom ke Abasi adiinyeghe awo ake imiinịmme enwọñọ ami isio ke ufọk ammọ ye ke inie ammọ. Yak enyeghe utọ awo ado esio enyʌñ etem anye ukpọk!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 5:13">Ke ami afịd awo emaebọọrọ, “Amen,” emaenyʌñ etooro <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. Ndin ammọ emaenam naña ekenwọñọ.<verse eid="NEH 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 5:14" />Kpayeado, tọọñọ ke ayọhọ isua edịb nte Adidem Ataseeses akeda ukara, ke ini ekemmekke miin nte adaukara ammọ ke isọñ Yuda, tutu awuọ ayọhọ isua edịb mme duob mme iba ke ukara amọ, isua duob mme iba, ami ye nditọete mmi ikidiaha ndidia adaukara. <verse eid="NEH 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 5:15" />Ado mme adaukara se ikibem iso iba, se ikiba mbemiso ami, emaetʌkkọ mme awo enyʌñ esibọ ammọ sekel silfa aba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A-adooho ñkpọ nte kram 460</char></note> dian ye ndidia ye ukọd. Mme udiana ammọ ñko emaenyʌñ esitʌkkọ mbon awo. Ado ato ke ntak uteeñe Abasi ami ñkinamma ntoro. <verse eid="NEH 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 5:16" />Utu ke ado, ami mmaayaak idem mmi nnọ utom ndibene ami. Afịd ikọd mmi emaedisoobo do nọ enam utom ado; ñnyịn ikideppe isọñ ndomokeed.<verse eid="NEH 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 5:17" />Ke ami amaakeboiyo, mme Yuu ye mme adaaha ikie mme aba mme duob (150) ye mbon mfen ake eketooho ñkanñkʌk idịd ekesidia ñkpọ ke akpokoro mmi. <verse eid="NEH 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 5:18" />Kwa usen ekesitem abaakenañ keed, mfọọn idem edọñ itiokeed ñkọrọ mme unen ennọ miin, ndin kwa usen duob ennọ uwak nsio-nsio utọ ukọd. Kpa ye ami, akenam ami ñyemme ndidia ake enịmme enọ adaukara, sia mme ñkpọ se ekeyem eto mbon awo ado amaafiik ammọ ibọhọ.<verse eid="NEH 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 5:19" />Ntoiyo miin ye mfọn, Abasi mmi, ke afịd se nnam nnọ mbon ami.<verse eid="NEH 5:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="NEH 6" />
  <para style="s1">Ñkaiso Ubiọọñọ ke Umaana Mbọp Ndibene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 6:1" />Ke ini Sanbalad, Tobia, Kesem awo Arab ye mme asua ñnyịn mbon ako ekekoppo ke ami mmaamaana mbọp ndibene, ñko ke ufañ ndomokeed ikibaaha aba, akpesʌkado ami mmeñkedọññọ udọk ke inuaatob diin; <verse eid="NEH 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 6:2" />Sanbalad ye Kesem emaedọñ utom ennọ ebo: “Di, yak ñnyịn isoobo ke esịd idʌñ keed ke unaisọñ Ọnọ.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 6:2">Ado ammọ ekeduak adinnam miin ibak; <verse eid="NEH 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 6:3" />anam ami mmaadọñ mme isʌñutom nnọ ammọ ye ibọọrọ ami: “Ami nnam ataa ekamba utom anam ndiikanna ndi. Ntaha ake utom akpetreke nọ ami nsọiyọ ibịne ndufo-o?” <verse eid="NEH 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 6:4" />Ammọ emaendọñ ukem utom ado akañ inaañ ennọ miin, ndin ami ñnyʌñ nnọ ammọ ukem ibọọrọ kwa ini.<verse eid="NEH 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 6:5" />Ndin, ayọhọ akañ ition, Sanbalad amaadọñ awo amọ ukem utom ado annọ, ndin awo amọ amaakama ñwed ake awo imiikidianna inua <verse eid="NEH 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 6:6" />e-ekewette ke esịd ete:</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="NEH 6:6">“Etañ ke atu mme idịd, ñko Kesem<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ke Hibru Kasmu asʌk ado Kesem</char></note> ate ke ado akpanikọ, ke afo ye mme Yuu eduak adisọñ iwuod, ndin ke anye asịn ndufo ebọp ndibene. Ke akanna ado, naña ikọ ami asaña, ete ke afo abiido adidem ammọ <verse eid="NEH 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 6:7" />ñko ke amesosio mme prọfed ate etañ ikọ ami ubaña fiin ke Yeruselem: ‘Adidem mmọdo ke Yuda!’ Ndin ikọ ami ayaadʌk adidem utọñ; kap di, yak isoobo.”<verse eid="NEH 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 6:8" />Ami mmaadọñ utom nnọ anye mbo ntom: “Utọ ñkpọ a-afo atañña do itịppeke; afo afiọk akere anye ado ke iwuod mfo atañ.”<verse eid="NEH 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 6:9" />Afịd ammọ ekenwana adisịn ñnyịn ndịk ke idem, ekere ebo, “Ubọk ayaanekke amem ammọ tutu ammọ ikanna inam utom ado aba, ndin awo idiikweeñeke.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 6:9">Ado ami mmaabọñ akam, “Idahami nsọọñọ miin ubọk.”<verse eid="NEH 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 6:10" />Usen keed ami mmaakaa ufọk Semaiya ayịn Delaiya, ayịn Mehetabel, e-ekekʌkkọ esịn ke ufọk amọ. Anye amaabo, “Yak ñnyịn isoobo ke ufọk Abasi, ke esịd tembịd, yak ñnyịn inyʌñ ibeet udọk tembịd, sia mme awo esʌkedi eduwot fiin, ammọ esʌkedi akonayio eduwot fiin.”<verse eid="NEH 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 6:11" />Ado ami mmaabo, “Ado se awo nte ami ñkpefeghe? Me awo nte ami ñkpedʌk tembịd mbaak akenyaaña uwem amọ? Ndiikaaha!” <verse eid="NEH 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 6:12" />Ami mmaakịt ke idooho Abasi akedọñ anye, ado ke aketañ idiọọk prọfesi ambaña miin sia Tobia ye Sanbalad emaekpe anye akʌk. <verse eid="NEH 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 6:13" />Ekekpe anye nọ ansịn miin ndịk ke idem mbaak ke adinam ntoro ami ndue, nọ ammọ ennọ idiọọk anyịñ adinsuenne miin.<verse eid="NEH 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 6:14" />Abasi mmi, toiyo Tobia ye Sanbalad, ke se ammọ ekenam; nyʌñ toiyo prọfed Noadia ye naña anye ye mme prọfed mbon ako esʌk esinwana adinsịn miin ndịk ke idem. <verse eid="NEH 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 6:15" />Emaebọp ndibene ema ke ayọhọ usen afiọñ edịb mme ition ke Elul, ke usen aba mme duob mme iba.<verse eid="NEH 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ubiọñọ ke Ndibene Ekebọppọ Ema</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 6:16" />Ke ini afịd mme asua ñnyịn ekekoppo ebaña ami, afịd mme idịd e-ekannake ñnyịn ekʌk emaekop ndịk enyʌñ ekịt usʌhọde itie ammọ, sia ammọ emaekịt ke ekenam utom ami ke unwam Abasi ñnyịn.<verse eid="NEH 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 6:17" />Ñko, ke mme usen ado mme mbọọñ Yuda emaenọ uwak ñwed esọk Tobia, ndin ibọọrọ amaanyʌñ ato Tobia abịne ammọ. <verse eid="NEH 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 6:18" />Sia uwak awo ke Yuda emaeta unwọñọ enọ anye, sia anye akedooho ebe ayịn Sekanaiya ayịn Ara, ndin ayịn amọ Yehohanan akedọ ayịn awonwaan Mesulam ayịn Berekia. <verse eid="NEH 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 6:19" />Ñko, ammọ emaesʌk ekaa iso etañ ebaña mme nti adinam amọ ennọ miin enyʌñ edọkkọ anye se ami ñketañ. Ndin Tobia amaanọ mme ñwed ensọk nọ ato do ami ñkop ndịk.<verse eid="NEH 6:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="NEH 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 7:1" />Ke emaekemaana ebọp ndibene ima ñnyʌñ ndọọñ udọk ke itie, emaemek mme akpeme inuaatob, mme akwọikwọ ye mme Lifai. <verse eid="NEH 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 7:2" />Ami ñkenam ayịneka mmi awodeen Hanani, ye Hananaiya adaiso mbon ukpeme ese ñkpọ ebaña Yeruselem, sia anye akedo awo akpanikọ anyʌñ abaak Abasi akan uwak awo. <verse eid="NEH 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 7:3" />Ami mmaabo ammọ nte, “Inaaha ebeere inuaatob Yeruselem tutu ayio asakka anekke afiop. Naña mme akpeme inuaatob esʌkkọ eba ke utom, yak ammọ ebeet mme usʌñ enyʌñ ekpaha. Ñko inyʌñ imek mbon se idʌñ ke Yeruselem nte mbon ukpeme, ubaak awo eba ke mme itie ukpeme ndin ubaak awo ekpeme nte akpere ufọk ammọ.”<verse eid="NEH 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Anyịñ mme Ntañmfeb se Ikinyọñ Idi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 7:4" />Ndin abio amaakpon anyʌñ anwaña, ado mme awo ikiwakka ke esịd, awo ikinyʌññọ imaana ibọọp mme ufọk diin. <verse eid="NEH 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 7:5" />Ndin Abasi amaasịn akikere ke esịd mmi ate ñkoot mme mbọọñ, mme adaaha ye mme ñkaña awo mbok nọ ediiwet anyịñ ammọ ke ubon ke ubon. Ami mmaakịt ñwed e-ekewette anyịñ mbon e-ekedooho akpa se ikitịmme inyọñ idi. Se ami ñkekịt nte ewet do ado ami:<verse eid="NEH 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 7:6" />Mbon ami edoñño mme awo ke ikpeghe abio e-eketooho ñkọbntem edi, a-Nebukadnesa, adidem Babilọn akekoonoke aka ñkọbntem (ammọ emaenyọñọ ekaa Yeruselem ye Yuda, anie abio amọ anyọñ, <verse eid="NEH 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 7:7" />esaña ye Serubabel, Yọsua, Nehimaiya, Asaria, Raamia, Nahamani, Mọdekai, Bilsan, Mispered, Bikfai, Nehum ye Baana):</para>
  <para style="b" vid="NEH 7:7" />
  <para style="li4" vid="NEH 7:7">Ibad ye anyịñ ideen mbon Isrel:<verse eid="NEH 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 7:8" />mme nditọ</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NEH 7:8">Paros, tọsịn iba mme ikie mme ata mme duob mme iba (2,172).<verse eid="NEH 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 7:9" />Nditọ Sefatia ekedoñño ikie ita mme ata mme duob mme iba (372).<verse eid="NEH 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 7:10" />Nditọ Ara ekedo ikie itiokeed mme aba mme duob mme iba (652).<verse eid="NEH 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 7:11" />Pahad-Moab (ato udịm Yesua ye Yoab), tọsịn iba mme ikie itiaita mme duob mme itiaita (2,818).<verse eid="NEH 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 7:12" />Elam, tọsịn keed mme ikie iba mme aba mme duob mme inaañ (1,254).<verse eid="NEH 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 7:13" />Satu, ikie itiaita mme aba mme ition (845).<verse eid="NEH 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 7:14" />Sakai, ikie itiaba mme ata (760).<verse eid="NEH 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 7:15" />Binui, ikie itiokeed mme aba mme itiaita (648).<verse eid="NEH 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 7:16" />Bebai, ikie itiokeed mme edịb mme itiaita (628).<verse eid="NEH 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 7:17" />Askad, tọsịn iba mme ikie ita mme edịb mme iba (2,322).<verse eid="NEH 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 7:18" />Adọnikam, ikie itiokeed mme ata mme itiaba (667).<verse eid="NEH 7:18" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 7:19" />Bikfai, tọsịn iba mme ata mme itiaba (2,067).<verse eid="NEH 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 7:20" />Adịn, ikie itiokeed mme aba mme duob mme ition (655).<verse eid="NEH 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 7:21" />Nditọ Ataa (tutu asịm Hesikaiya), ekedo anaañ mme duob mme itiaita (98).<verse eid="NEH 7:21" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 7:22" />Nditọ Hasum ekedo ikie ita mme edịb mme itiaita (328).<verse eid="NEH 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 7:23" />Besai, ikie ita mme edịb mme inaañ (324),<verse eid="NEH 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 7:24" />Harif, ikie keed mme duob mme iba (112).<verse eid="NEH 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 7:25" />Kibiọn, anaañ mme duob mme ition (95).<verse eid="NEH 7:25" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 7:26" />Mbon Betlehem ye Netofa, ikie mme anaañ mme itiaita (188).<verse eid="NEH 7:26" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 7:27" />Nditọ Anatod, ikie mme edịb mme itiaita (128).<verse eid="NEH 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 7:28" />Nditọ Bed-Asmafed ekedo aba mme iba (42).<verse eid="NEH 7:28" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 7:29" />Nditọ Kiriad Yerịm, Kefira ye Beerod ekedo ikie itiaba mme aba mme ita (743)<verse eid="NEH 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 7:30" />mbon Rama ye Keba ekedo ikie itiokeed mme edịb mme keed (621)<verse eid="NEH 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 7:31" />mbon Mikmas, ikie mme edịb mme iba (122)<verse eid="NEH 7:31" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NEH 7:32" />mbon Beteel ye Ai, ikie mme edịb mme ita (123)<verse eid="NEH 7:32" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="NEH 7:33" />mbon Nebo anye ako, aba mme duob mme iba (52)<verse eid="NEH 7:33" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="NEH 7:34" />mbon Elam anye ako, tọsịn keed mme ikie iba mme aba mme duob mme inaañ (1,254)<verse eid="NEH 7:34" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NEH 7:35" />mbon Harim, ikie ita mme edịb (320)<verse eid="NEH 7:35" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NEH 7:36" />mbon Yeriko, ikie ita mme aba mme ition (345)<verse eid="NEH 7:36" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="NEH 7:37" />mbon Lod, Hadid ye Ọnọ, ikie itiaba mme edịb mme keed (721)<verse eid="NEH 7:37" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NEH 7:38" />mbon Senaa, tọsịn ita mme ikie usʌkkeed mme edịb mme duob (3,930).<verse eid="NEH 7:38" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="NEH 7:39" />Mme aku:</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 7:39">e-edooho ubon</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NEH 7:39">Yedaiya (e-etooho ufọk Yesua) ikie usʌkkeed mme ata mme duob mme ita (973)<verse eid="NEH 7:39" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="NEH 7:40" />Nditọ Imma, tọsịn keed mme aba mme duob mme iba (1,052).<verse eid="NEH 7:40" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="NEH 7:41" />Nditọ Pasọ, tọsịn keed mme ikie iba mme aba mme itiaba (1,247).<verse eid="NEH 7:41" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="NEH 7:42" />Nditọ Harim, tọsịn keed mme duob mme itiaba (1,017).<verse eid="NEH 7:42" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="NEH 7:43" />Mme Lifai:</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 7:43">ubon</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NEH 7:43">Yesua (e-etooho Kadmiel ke ufọk Hodafia), ata mme duob mme inaañ.<verse eid="NEH 7:43" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="NEH 7:44" />Mme akwọikwọ:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NEH 7:44">nditọ</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NEH 7:44">Asaf, ikie keed mme aba mme itiaita (148).<verse eid="NEH 7:44" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="NEH 7:45" />Mme akpeme inuaatob tembịd:</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 7:45">nditọ</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NEH 7:45">Salum, Ataa, Talmọn,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NEH 7:45">Akub, Hatita ye Sobai, ikie keed mme edịb mme duob mme itiaita (138).<verse eid="NEH 7:45" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="NEH 7:46" />Mme anamutom ke tembịd:</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 7:46">nditọ</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NEH 7:46">Siha, Hasufa, Tabod,<verse eid="NEH 7:46" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="NEH 7:47" />Keros, Sia, Padon,<verse eid="NEH 7:47" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="NEH 7:48" />Lebana, Hakaba, Salmai,<verse eid="NEH 7:48" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="NEH 7:49" />Hanan, Kidel, Kaha,<verse eid="NEH 7:49" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="NEH 7:50" />Reiya, Resịn, Nekoda,<verse eid="NEH 7:50" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="NEH 7:51" />Kasam, Usa, Pasei,<verse eid="NEH 7:51" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="NEH 7:52" />Besai, Meunịm, Nefusịm,<verse eid="NEH 7:52" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="NEH 7:53" />Bakbuk, Hakufa, Hahọọ,<verse eid="NEH 7:53" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="NEH 7:54" />Baslud, Mehida, Haasa,<verse eid="NEH 7:54" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="NEH 7:55" />Bakos, Sisera, Tema,<verse eid="NEH 7:55" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="NEH 7:56" />Nesia ye Hatifa.<verse eid="NEH 7:56" /></para>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="NEH 7:57" />Mme ntịppe ubon nditọufọk Sọlọmọn:</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 7:57">nditọ</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NEH 7:57">Sotai, Sofered, Perida,<verse eid="NEH 7:57" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="NEH 7:58" />Yaala, Daakọn, Kidel,<verse eid="NEH 7:58" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="NEH 7:59" />Sefatia, Hatil,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NEH 7:59">Pokered-Hasebaim ye Amọn<verse eid="NEH 7:59" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="NEH 7:60" />Mme anamutom ke tembịd ye nditọ ake nditọufọk Sọlọmọn, ikie ita mme anaañ mme duob mme iba (392).<verse eid="NEH 7:60" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="NEH 7:61" />Mbon ami eketo mme abio ke Tel Mela, Tel Haasa, Kerub, Adon ye Imaa, ado ammọ ikikanna iwọt ibo ke mme ubon mmimọ eketo ntịppe Isrel:<verse eid="NEH 7:61" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="NEH 7:62" />mme nditọ</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NEH 7:62">Delaiya, Tobia ye Nekoda ikie itiokeed mme aba mme iba (642).<verse eid="NEH 7:62" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="NEH 7:63" />Ndin mbon se ikito ke atu mme aku:</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 7:63">mme nditọ</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NEH 7:63">Hobaiya, Hakos, Basilai (awodeen keed a-akedọọhọ ayịn awonwaan Basilai awo Kilied ndin ekekoot anye ke anyịñ ado).<verse eid="NEH 7:63" /></para>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="NEH 7:64" />Mbon ami emaeyem ñwed emana ubon ammọ, ado ammọ ikikanna ikịt ndin ado akenam esio ammọ efep ke itie ñkpọ mme aku, nte ammọ isanake. <verse eid="NEH 7:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="NEH 7:65" />Ke ntoro, adaukara amaanọ uyio ate ke inaaha ammọ edia ñkpọ ndomokeed ke atu mme ataa ndisana ndidia tutu aku aba a-akamake Urim ye Tumịm anam utom.<verse eid="NEH 7:65" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="NEH 7:66" />Afịd atutu awo ado ekedo tọsịn aba mme iba ikie ita mme ata (42,360), <verse eid="NEH 7:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="NEH 7:67" />ke esioho mme ifʌn ibaan ye ifʌn ideen ekedooho awo tọsịn itiaba, ikie ita mme edịb mme duob mme itiaba (7,337); emaenyʌñ enie mme akwọikwọ ideen ye ibaan ikie iba mme aba mme ition (245). <verse eid="NEH 7:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="NEH 7:68" />Enañmbakara ekedo ikie itiaba mme edịb mme duob mme itiokeed (736), kamel edo ikie iba mme aba mme ition (245), <verse eid="NEH 7:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="NEH 7:69" />kamel ikie inaañ mme edịb mme duob mme ition (435) ye dọñki tọsịn itiokeed, ikie itiaba mme edịb (6,720).<verse eid="NEH 7:69" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="NEH 7:70" />Usʌk mme mbọọñ ufọk emaenọ ñkpọ ekama enam utom. Adaukara amaanọ darik kold tọsịn keed (1,000)<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:70 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A-adooho ñkpọ nte kilokram 8.4</char></note>, bọwịd aba mme duob ye afọñ mme aku ikie ition mme edịb mme duob (530) nọ esịn ke itie unịm akʌk. <verse eid="NEH 7:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="NEH 7:71" />Usʌk mbọọñ ufọk emaenọ darik kold tọsịn edịb (20,000)<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:71 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A-adooho ñkpọ nte kilokram 170; se ñko ke Neh 7:72</char></note> ye mina silfa tọsịn iba mme ikie iba (2,200)<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:71 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A-adooho ñkpọ nte tọọn 1 1/3 me ñkpọ nte metrịk tọọn 1.2</char></note> esịn ke itie unịm akʌk ekama enam utom. <verse eid="NEH 7:71" /><verse number="72" style="v" sid="NEH 7:72" />Afịd se mbon mfen ekenọọ tañ dian akedo darik kold tọsịn edịb (20,000), mina silfa tọsịn iba (2,000)<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:72 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A-adooho ñkpọ nte tọọn 1 1/4 me ñkpọ nte metrịk tọọn 1.1</char></note> ye afọñ nsiine mme aku ata mme itiaba (67).<verse eid="NEH 7:72" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="NEH 7:73" />Mme aku, mme Lifai, mme akpeme inuaatob, mme akwọikwọ ye mme anamutom ke tembịd, mbon awo mfen ye mme nditọ Isrel se ikisʌhọ, emaekedʌñọ ke mme abio ammọ.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="NEH 7:73">Esra Akoot Mbed</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 7:73">Ke amaakediwuọ ayọhọ afiọñ itiaba nọ nditọ Isrel eba ke mme abio ammọ,<verse eid="NEH 7:73" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="NEH 8" />
  <para style="nb">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 8:1" />afịd awo emaedisoobo itie keed ke anwa a-adaaha ke iso Inuaatob Mmọọñ. Ammọ emaebo Esra andikpeeb Mbed ete yak asio Ñwed Mbed Moses, anye ake <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akewuuhọ Isrel, aben adi.<verse eid="NEH 8:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 8:2" />Anam ke akpa usen ke ayọhọ afiọñ itiaba aku Esra amaaben ñwed Mbed adi ke esob, a-akedooho ibaan ye ideen ye afịd mbon se ikidiọọñọ ñkpọ. <verse eid="NEH 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 8:3" />Anye amaada ke iso anwa Inuaatob Mmọọñ akoot ñwed ado tọọñọ ke usiere tutu ufọọd uweemeayio ke iso ideen, ibaan ye mbon mfen se ikidọọñọ ke esịd ñwed ado akenwaña. Ndin afịd awo emaekpañ utọñ enọ Ñwed Mbed.<verse eid="NEH 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 8:4" />Esra andikpeeb Mbed amaadọọk ada ke anyọñ anyan akpokoro eto e-ekebọppọ enọ adinam ado. Ado Matitia, Sema, Anaiya, Yuria, Hilkia ye Maaseiya ekeda anye ke ñkañ ke ubọk nnasia; Pedaiya, Miseel, Malkiya, Hasum, Hasbadana, Sakaraiya ye Mesulam emaenyʌñ eda anye ke ubọk ufiin.<verse eid="NEH 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 8:5" />Esra amaakʌppọ ñwed. Afịd awo emaekịt anye sia anye akeda ke ñkpọ se inyọọñ; ndin nte anye akʌppọke ñwed, afịd awo emaedaaña edada. <verse eid="NEH 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 8:6" />Esra amaatooro <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, akwa Abasi; ndin afịd awo emaebenne ubọk ke anyọñ enyʌñ ebọọrọ, “Amen! Amen!” Ndin ammọ emaenyuuk iwuod enyʌñ ekpono <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, etuuk iso ke isọñ.<verse eid="NEH 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 8:7" />Mme Lifai: Yesua, Bani, Serebia, Yamịn, Akub, Sabetai, Hodia, Maaseiya, Kelita, Asaria, Yoosabad, Hanan ye Pelaiya emaekpeep mme awo ebaña Mbed ke ini mme awo ekedaaha do. <verse eid="NEH 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 8:8" />Ammọ emaekoot Ñwed Mbed Abasi, enam ikọ ado anwaña enyʌñ ewọt mme awo se ikọ ado akewuọñọ nọ anwaña ammọ.<verse eid="NEH 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 8:9" />Ndin Nehimaiya adaukara, Esra aku ye andikpeeb Mbed ye mme Lifai e-ekesʌkkọ ekpeep mbon awo ñkpọ emaebo afịd ammọ ete, “Usen mfịn ami ado adisana anọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo. Ndufo ikiiseeme ikiinyʌñ itua ayịd.” Sia afịd awo eketuatua naña ekoppo mme ikọ Mbed ado.<verse eid="NEH 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 8:10" />Nehimaiya amaabo ate, “Ndufo ikaa ikidia nti ndidia inyʌñ inwọñ inịññe mmịn, inyʌñ inọ ubaak esọk mbon i-imiinieghe se etem. Usen mfịn ami ado adisana anọ Abọọñ ñnyịn. Ndufo ikiifʌhọ, sia idadesịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ado adudu ndufo.”<verse eid="NEH 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 8:11" />Mme Lifai emaenam afịd awo etekke idem, ebo ammọ ete, “Ndufo idop, sia mfịn ado adisana usen. Ikiifʌhọ.”<verse eid="NEH 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 8:12" />Ndin afịd awo emaedakka ekaa adidia ñnyʌñ ñnwọñ ñkpọ, ñnyʌñ nnọọ ndidia esọk mme awo ñnyʌñ nnam usọrọ ye ekamba idaara, sia idaha ado mme ikọ e-ekebenne ewọt ammọ emaenam anwaña ammọ ndin.<verse eid="NEH 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 8:13" />Ke ayọhọ usen iba ke afiọñ, mme mbọọñ ufọk, ye mme aku ye mme Lifai, emaeboho ekanna Esra andikpeeb, nọ ato do ammọ enekke ekpeep ediọọñọ mme ikọ Mbed. <verse eid="NEH 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 8:14" />Ammọ emaekịt nte ewet ke ñwed Mbed, ake <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akenọọhọ uyio ato Moses, ate ke ana nte nditọ Isrel edʌñ ke mme itie idʌñ ebọppọ ke ibio ke ini usọrọ ayọhọ afiọñ itiaba <verse eid="NEH 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 8:15" />ñko ke akena nte ammọ ekwọrọ ikọ ami enyʌñ esuan anye ke afịd mme abio ammọ ye ke Yeruselem: “Iwuọñọ ikaa abod-abod abio inyʌñ ikedat mme ñkọk ọlif ye eto ọlif esịd ikọd, ye ake meetel, ake mme ayob ye ake mme eto ake esinọọhọ mfuud, idi nọ idinam mme atayad,” naña ekewet.<verse eid="NEH 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 8:16" />Ndin mme awo emaewuọñọ ekedat mme ñkọk enyʌñ edibọp mme atayad enọ idem ammọ ke mme akọm ufọk ammọ, ke akwere ammọ, ke akwere ufọk Abasi ye ke anwa Inuaatob Mmọọñ ye ake Inuaatob Ifrem. <verse eid="NEH 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 8:17" />Afịd atutu awo se ikito itie eketañña ammọ ekebon ke ufʌn emaebọp atayad enyʌñ edʌñ ke esịd. Tọọñọ ke ayio Yọsua ayịn Nọn tutu awuọ usen ado, nditọ Isrel ikinamma usọrọ ado ke utọ usʌñ ami. Ndin idadesịd ammọ amaanekke akpon.<verse eid="NEH 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 8:18" />Ke usen ke usen, tọọñọ ke akpa usen tutu awuọ akpatre, Esra amaakoot ke Ñwed Mbed Abasi. Ammọ emaedia usọrọ ado usen itiaba, ndin ke ayọhọ usen itiaita, naña mbed aketemme, ammọ emaenịm ekamba esob.<verse eid="NEH 8:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="NEH 9" />
  <para style="s1">Nditọ Isrel Eyaara Mme Idiọọkñkpọ Ammọ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 9:1" />Ke ayọhọ usen edịb mme inaañ ke ukem afiọñ ado, nditọ Isrel emaesoobo itie keed, etie utreudia, esịne afọñikpo enyʌñ eduọk ntọñ ke iwuod ammọ. <verse eid="NEH 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 9:2" />Mbon se ikito ubon Isrel emaediañña idem ekpọñ mme isenawo. Ammọ emaeda ke mme itie ammọ enyʌñ eyaara mme idiọọkñkpọ ammọ ye mme idiọọkñkpọ mme eteete ammọ. <verse eid="NEH 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 9:3" />Ammọ emaeda ke itie nte ekeda enyʌñ ekoot Ñwed Mbed <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ammọ ke mbakka keed ke itie inaañ ke usen, enyʌñ edat mbakka keed ke itie inaañ mfen eyaara mme idiọọkñkpọ ammọ enyʌñ ekpono <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ammọ. <verse eid="NEH 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 9:4" />Mbon se ikida ke mme udodukod adọọhọ itie mme Lifai ekedo Yesua, Bani, Kadmiel, Sebania, Buni, Serebia, Bani ye Kenani. Ammọ emaetua ekoot <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ammọ ke akpọsọñ uyio. <verse eid="NEH 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 9:5" />Ndin mme Lifai: Yesua, Kadmiel, Bani, Hasabneiya, Serebia, Hodia, Sebania ye Petahia emaebo ete: “Ndufo idakka ida itooro <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo, a-abaaha ke nsi-nsi nsi-nsi.”</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="NEH 9:5">Itooro anie anyịñ ubọọñ mfo, ndin yak ebenne anye ke anyọñ ekan afịd adidiọñ ye itooro. <verse eid="NEH 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 9:6" />Afo ikpọọñ ado <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. Afo akenam mme hefịn, kpa ye ataa mme ñkoññkan hefịn, ye afịd udịm ntantaafiọñ, isọñ ye afịd se iyọhọ ke esịd, mme akpainyañ ye afịd se idọñọ ke esịd. Afo anọọ afịd ñkpọ uwem, ndin udịm anyọñ etuak iwuod ukpono fiin.<verse eid="NEH 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 9:7" />“Afo ado <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi, a-akemekke Ebram anyʌñ asio anye ke Ọọ mbon Kaldi anyʌñ asio anye anyịñ Ebraham. <verse eid="NEH 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 9:8" />Afo amaakịt ke esịd amọ anie akpanikọ unọ fiin, ndin afo amaanam edioomo ye anye adinọ ubon amọ isọñ mbon Kenan, Hed, Amọọ, Peris, Yebus ye Keekasi. Afo amaanam enwọñọ mfo sia afo ado adinen.<verse eid="NEH 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 9:9" />“Afo amaakịt ukuud mme eteete ñnyịn ke Iyib; amaakop eseeme ammọ ke mben Ndad-ndad Inyañ. <verse eid="NEH 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 9:10" />Afo amaawọt Fero mme idiọọñọ ye mme utịppeñkpọ, anyʌñ awọt mme adaaha amọ ye afịd awo ke abio amọ, sia afo amaadiọọñọ naña mbon Iyib ekenam ñkpọ ye ammọ ñwọdidem-ñwọdidem. Afo amaanam anyịñ anọ idem mfo, ake asʌkkọ ababa tutu mfịn ami. <verse eid="NEH 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 9:11" />Afo amaabakka akpainyañ ke iso ammọ, ndin ammọ emaesaña eboiyo ke nsaad isọñ, ado afo amaaben mme andikibịne ammọ adọñ ke udem, nte itiad ke etop esịn ke ekamba mmọọñ. <verse eid="NEH 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 9:12" />Afo amaadat ammọ usʌñ ke abai ntọñanyọñ ke uweemeayio, ye ke abai ikañ ke akonayio nọ anọ ammọ unwana ke usʌñ isañ ammọ.<verse eid="NEH 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 9:13" />“Afo amaasọiyọ adi ke Abod Sainai; atie ke anyọñ atañ ikọ anọ ammọ. Afo amaanọ ammọ mme ewʌhọ ye mme mbed enenne enyʌñ edo akpanikọ, ye mme ewʌhọ ye ikọ ndadusʌñ se ifọn. <verse eid="NEH 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 9:14" />Afo amaanam ammọ ediọọñọ adisana Sabad mfo anyʌñ anọ ammọ mme ikọ ndadusʌñ, mme ewʌhọ ye mme mbed ato ubọk Moses awo utom mfo. <verse eid="NEH 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 9:15" />Ke ini abiọọñ akedọññọ ammọ afo amaanọ ammọ uyo a-aketooho anyọñ ndin ke ini itọñ akesatta ammọ afo amaasio mmọọñ ke itiad anọ ammọ; afo amaabo ammọ eka ekedat isọñ ado ake afo akebenneke ubọk anwọñọ abo ke iyainọ ammọ enie.<verse eid="NEH 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 9:16" />“Ado ammọ, mme eteete ñnyịn, emaetañ idem enyʌñ esọñ aboditọñ, inyʌññọ isaña ke mme ikọ ndadusʌñ mfo. <verse eid="NEH 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 9:17" />Ammọ emaesịn adikpañ utọñ unọọ inyʌññọ itoiyo mme utịppeñkpọ ake afo akenamma ke atu ammọ. Ammọ emaesọñ aboditọñ ndin ke nsọñiwuod ammọ, ammọ emaemek adadusʌñ nọ ato do ammọ etịmme eka itie ufʌn ammọ. Ado afo ado Abasi a-adakkake anọ awo, a-ayọhọke ye mfọn ye mbọm, usọppọ iyadesịd anyʌñ anie uwak ima. Ke ntoro afo ukukpọññọ ammọ, <verse eid="NEH 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 9:18" />kpayeado ammọ ekenamma ubobod ñyịn enañ enyʌñ ebo ete, ‘Anye ami ado abasi ndufo, a-akisioho ndufo ke Iyib,’ me ke ini ammọ ekesappake nsappa idiọọk-idiọọk.<verse eid="NEH 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 9:19" />“Ke ntak akwa mbọm mfo afo ukukpọññọ ammọ ke anaan. Abai ntọñanyọñ ikitreke adidat ammọ usʌñ uweemeayio, ake abai ikañ aketreke adiyamma ke usʌñ isañ ammọ ke akonayio. <verse eid="NEH 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 9:20" />Afo amaanọ ammọ eti Sịbidịd mfo adinọ ammọ item. Afo ukusioho mana mfo ke inua ammọ ufep, amaanyʌñ anọ ammọ mmọọñ ke ini itọñ akesatta ammọ. <verse eid="NEH 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 9:21" />Afo amaamʌm ammọ akama ke anaan ke isua aba; ammọ ikinanake ñkpọ, afọñ ammọ ikitahake ake ñkpad ammọ akeyọọhọ.<verse eid="NEH 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 9:22" />“Afo amaanọ ammọ mme abioubọọñ ye mme idịd, tutu akewuọ ataa akpatre idʌñ. Ammọ emaedat isọñ Sihọn adidem Hesbọn ye isọñ Ọk adidem Basan. <verse eid="NEH 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 9:23" />Afo amaanam nditọ ammọ ewak nte ntantaafiọñ ke ikpaanyọñ, amaanyʌñ aben ammọ adʌk isọñ ado a-afo akebooho mme eteete ammọ ekedʌk enyʌñ edat enie. <verse eid="NEH 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 9:24" />Nditọ ammọ emaedʌk ekedat isọñ ado. Afo amaakan mbon Kenan, ake ekedʌññọ ke isọñ ado, ke iso ammọ; amaayaak mbon Kenan asịn ammọ ke ubọk, dian ye ndidem ammọ ye mbon unie isọñ, nọ ammọ enam ammọ naña emama. <verse eid="NEH 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 9:25" />Ammọ emaedat mme ñkpọsọñ abio se inie ndibene, ye isọñ se ifọn ñkpọ; ammọ emaekoono mme ufọk ake se utọ se utọ nti ñkpọ eyọhọke ke esịd, mme ube mmọọñ ake emaeketetịppe, mme inwañ fain, mme inwañ ọlif ye uwak eto mfịd. Ammọ emaedia eyʌkkọ enyʌñ ekop idem; ammọ emaekop inem ke akwa mfọn mfo.<verse eid="NEH 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 9:26" />“Ado ammọ emaetre utọñ enyʌñ esọñ iwuod ye afo; ammọ emaekpa edem ewọt mme mbed mfo. Ammọ emaewot mme prọfed mfo, e-ekesuaha enọ ammọ nọ ammọ ekpetịmme ubịne fiin; ammọ emaesappa nsappa idiọọk-idiọọk. <verse eid="NEH 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 9:27" />Anam afo amaayaak ammọ asịn ke ubọk mme asua ammọ, e-ekefiighe ammọ. Ado ke ini ekefiighe ammọ, ammọ emaeseeme unọ fiin. Afo amaatie ke anyọñ akop ammọ, ndin ke akwa mbọm mfo afo amaanọ ammọ mme andinyaaña, e-ekenyaañake ammọ esio ke ubọk mme asua ammọ.<verse eid="NEH 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 9:28" />“Ado ammọ ekesʌk eduọduọk adudu ema, ammọ emaemaana enam idiọọk ke iso mfo. Ndin afo amaakpọñ ammọ ke ubọk mme asua ammọ nọ ekaara ammọ. Ndin ke ammọ emaekemaana eseeme unọ fiin, afo amaatie ke anyọñ akop, ndin ke mbọm mfo afo amaanyaaña ammọ kwa ini kwa ini.<verse eid="NEH 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 9:29" />“Afo amaasua anọ ammọ nọ ato do ammọ etịmme ekenam mbed mfo, ado ammọ emaenam ntañidem enyʌñ ekpọñ edisaña ke mme ikọ ndadusʌñ mfo. Ammọ emaedue edinam mme item mfo, a-afo akebooho ate, ‘Awo a-anamma mme item ayaadu uwem ke ammọ.’ Ammọ emaekpa edem uwọt fiin ke nsọñiwuod, esọñ aboditọñ enyʌñ esịn adikop ñkpọ. <verse eid="NEH 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 9:30" />Afo amaame ime ye ammọ ke uwak isua. Amaaboiyo ke mme prọfed mfo akama Sịbidịd mfo asua anọ ammọ. Ado ammọ ikinọọhọ utọñ, anam afo amaayaak ammọ asịn ke ubọk mme mbọhọ ammọ. <verse eid="NEH 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 9:31" />Ado ke akwa mbọm mfo afo ukusoboke ammọ, ukunyʌññọ ukpọñ ammọ, sia afo ado Abasi mfọn ye mbọm.<verse eid="NEH 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NEH 9:32" />“Do ndin, Abasi ñnyịn, akwa Abasi, akpọsọñ ye anie uteeñe, afo ake anịmme edioomo ima mfo, kuuyak afịd ukuud ami aba nte etək ñkpọ ke iso mfo, ukuud ake isịmme ñnyịn, ake asịmme ndidem ye mme adadusʌñ ñnyịn, mme aku ye mme prọfed ñnyịn, mme eteete ñnyịn ye afịd ikọd mfo, tọọñọ ke ayio ndidem Asiria tutu awuọ mfịn. <verse eid="NEH 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NEH 9:33" />Ke afịd se itịppe inọ ñnyịn, afo asʌk ado adinen; afo amenam akpanikọ, ado ñnyịn imainam adiọọk. <verse eid="NEH 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NEH 9:34" />Mme ndidem ñnyịn, mme adadusʌñ ñnyịn, mme aku ñnyịn ye mme eteete ñnyịn ikinịmme mbed mfo; ammọ ikinọọhọ utọñ ke mme ewʌhọ mfo me ke mme item ake afo akebooho ammọ enịm. <verse eid="NEH 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NEH 9:35" />Idem idaha ammọ ekebaaha ke abio ammọ, ekop inem akwa mfọn mfo ye ammọ ke ekamba ye eti isọñ afo akenọọhọ ammọ, ammọ ikinamma ñkpọ unọ fiin ikinyʌññọ ikpọñ idiọọk usʌñ ammọ.<verse eid="NEH 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NEH 9:36" />“Ado, sese, ñnyịn idoñño mme ifʌn mfịn ami, ifʌn ke isọñ ake afo akenọọhọ mme eteete ñnyịn nọ ammọ ekeme adidia mfịd amọ ye mme nti ñkpọ mfen se anye anie. <verse eid="NEH 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NEH 9:37" />Ke ntak mme idiọọkñkpọ ñnyịn, afịd uwak mbunwịm amọ anie ndidem ake afo anịmme abo ikara ñnyịn. Ammọ ekara ñnyịn ye mme ufene ñnyịn naña ammọ emama. Ñnyịn iba ke ataa ekamba ukuud.<verse eid="NEH 9:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Unyịmme Mbon Awo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NEH 9:38" />“Ke ntak afịd mme ñkpọ ami, ñnyịn ibiinam edioomo a-asọññọ ada, i-iwet anye i-isịn ke ñwed, ndin mme adadusʌñ ñnyịn, mme Lifai ñnyịn ye mme aku ñnyịn esʌk efiik ke ufiikñwed ammọ.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:38 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ke ikpañwed Hibru ewet ufañ ami (Neh 9:38) nte Neh 10:1 </char></note><verse eid="NEH 9:38" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter eid="NEH 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="NEH 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">10: </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Ke ikpañwed Hibru ewet Neh 10:1-39 nte Nehimaiya 10:2-40</char>
    </note> <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 10:1" />Mbon se ikifiik ubọk ke ñwed ami ekedo:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="NEH 10:1" />
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 10:1">Adaukara:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NEH 10:1">Nehimaiya ayịn Hakalia.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="NEH 10:1" />
  <para style="li2" vid="NEH 10:1">Sedekaiya, <verse eid="NEH 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 10:2" />Seraiya, Asaria, Yerimaiya,<verse eid="NEH 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 10:3" />Pasọ, Amaria, Malkiya,<verse eid="NEH 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 10:4" />Hatus, Sebania, Maluk,<verse eid="NEH 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 10:5" />Harim, Meremọd, Obadaiya,<verse eid="NEH 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 10:6" />Dandiel, Kinetọn, Baruk,<verse eid="NEH 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 10:7" />Mesulam, Abiya, Miyamịn,<verse eid="NEH 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 10:8" />Maasia, Bilkai ye Semaiya.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 10:8">Mme aku ekedo ami.<verse eid="NEH 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 10:9" />Mme Lifai:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NEH 10:9">Yesua ayịn Asanaiya, Binui mme nditọ ideen Henadad, Kadmiel,<verse eid="NEH 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 10:10" />ye mme nsaña ammọ: Sebania,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NEH 10:10">Hodia, Kelita, Pelaiya, Hanan,<verse eid="NEH 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 10:11" />Mika, Rehob, Hasabaiya,<verse eid="NEH 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 10:12" />Saku, Serebia, Sebania,<verse eid="NEH 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 10:13" />Hodia, Bani ye Beninu.<verse eid="NEH 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 10:14" />Mme adadusʌñ mbon awo:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NEH 10:14">Paros, Pahad-Moab, Elam, Satu, Bani,<verse eid="NEH 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 10:15" />Buni, Askad, Bebai,<verse eid="NEH 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 10:16" />Adọniya, Bikfai, Adịn,<verse eid="NEH 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 10:17" />Ataa, Hesikaiya, Asọọ,<verse eid="NEH 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 10:18" />Hodia, Hasum, Besai,<verse eid="NEH 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 10:19" />Harif, Anatod, Nebai,<verse eid="NEH 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 10:20" />Makpias, Mesulam, Hesie,<verse eid="NEH 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 10:21" />Mesesabel, Sadọk, Yadua,<verse eid="NEH 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 10:22" />Pelatia, Hanan, Anaiya,<verse eid="NEH 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 10:23" />Hosie, Hananaiya, Hasub,<verse eid="NEH 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 10:24" />Halohes, Pilha, Sobek,<verse eid="NEH 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 10:25" />Rehum, Hasabna, Maaseiya,<verse eid="NEH 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 10:26" />Ahiya, Hanan, Anan,<verse eid="NEH 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 10:27" />Maluk, Harim ye Baana.<verse eid="NEH 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 10:28" />“Mbon se ikisʌhọ: mme aku, mme Lifai, mme akpeme inuaatob, mme akwọikwọ, mme anamutom ke tembịd ye afịd mbon se ikidiañña idem ikpọñ mbon idịd e-ekedʌññọ ediana ammọ ke ntak Mbed Abasi, ye mme ibaan ammọ ye mme nditọ ammọ ideen ye ibaan se inie iwuod ikan idiọọñọ ñkpọ; <verse eid="NEH 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 10:29" />afịd ami ediana ye nditọ Isrel ammọ, mme mbọọñ, enam isuuñọ ye unwọñọ adisaña ke Mbed Abasi ekenọọhọ eto ubọk Moses awo utom Abasi ye adinyʌñ ñkịt mbo ke iminam afịd item, mbed ye ewʌhọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ñnyịn.<verse eid="NEH 10:29" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 10:30" />“Ñnyịn iminwọñọ ibo ke ñnyịn idiinọọhọ mme ndʌñndiana idịd nditọ ibaan ñnyịn ke ndọ, idiinyʌññọ idọ nditọ ibaan ammọ inọ nditọ ideen ñnyịn.<verse eid="NEH 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 10:31" />“Mme ndʌñndiana idịd emaeben ñkpọ udua me mfịd inwañ ammọ idi adinyam ke usen Sabad, ñnyịn idiibọọhọ ammọ idep ke usen Sabad me ke adisana usen ndomokeed akeedodo. Kwa ayọhọ isua itiaba ñnyịn idiitọọhọ inwañ, ñko iyaibiat afịd isọn ifep, nọ mme andikama ekuukpe aba.<verse eid="NEH 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NEH 10:32" />“Ñnyịn iminyịmme idat nte ubiọñutom, adinọ mbaak sekel keed ke itie ita<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:32 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A-adooho ñkpọ nte kram 4</char></note> kwa isua nọ edat enam utom ke ufọk Abasi ñnyịn: <verse eid="NEH 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NEH 10:33" />uyo ke akpokoro; uwa ñkpasi ye ufọfọb uwa; enọ ke mme Sabad, ke mme usọrọ Ufa Afiọñ ye mme usọrọ mfen se iba; adisana enọ; uwa ufeen idiọọkñkpọ adinam ñkpeubọk nnọọ Isrel; ye afịd utom ufọk Abasi ñnyịn.<verse eid="NEH 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="NEH 10:34" />“Ñnyịn, mme aku, mme Lifai ye afịd awo, imisịn afia nọ ediọọñọ idaha mme ubon ñnyịn keedekeed ediisiben ifia idi ufọk Abasi ñnyịn ke ini ekedotto kwa isua nọ efọp ke akpokoro uwa <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ñnyịn, naña ewet ke Mbed.<verse eid="NEH 10:34" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NEH 10:35" />“Ñnyịn iminyʌñ inyịmme idat nte ubiọñutom, adiben akpa mfịd inwañ ñnyịn ye mme akpa mfịd afịd eto ndi ke ufọk <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> kwa isua.<verse eid="NEH 10:35" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NEH 10:36" />“Kpa naña esʌk ewet ke Mbed, ñnyịn iyaiben mme akpa nditọ ideen ñnyịn ye akpa ñyịnenañ ñnyịn, akpa ñyịnedọñ ye akpa ñyịnebod ñnyịn idi ufọk Abasi ñnyịn, idinọ mme aku se isaña utom do.<verse eid="NEH 10:36" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="NEH 10:37" />“Ke akanna ado, ñnyịn iyaiben akpa ukọkọk ndidia, enọ ñkpasi ñnyịn, akpa mfịd afịd eto ñnyịn ye ake ufa ukọd ye adan ọlif isọk mme aku ke ubeed ubonoñkpọ ke ufọk Abasi ñnyịn. Ñko iyainyʌñ iben ayọhọ mbaak duob ñkpọ inwañ ñnyịn isọk mme Lifai, sia ado mme Lifai esibọ ayọhọ mbaak duob ke afịd abio se ñnyịn inam utom. <verse eid="NEH 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NEH 10:38" />Aku keed a-atooho ufọk Erọn anie adisaña ye mme Lifai ke ini ammọ ebọọhọ keed ke mbaak duob, ndin mme Lifai enie ediben mbakka keed ke itie duob ake afịd mme enọ ado keed ke itie duob ñkesịn ke ufọk Abasi ñnyịn, ke ubeed ubonoñkpọ ake itie unịmñkpọ. <verse eid="NEH 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NEH 10:39" />Mbon Isrel, ye mme Lifai, enie adidat udeeme abakpa ammọ, ufa ukọd ye adan ọlif ndinịm ke mme ubeed ubonoñkpọ, itie e-ebonoke mme ñkpọ itieukpono ye ñkpọ mme aku e-esañake utom do, mme akpeme inuaatob ye mme akwọikwọ.</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="NEH 10:39">“Ñnyịn idiisioho anyen ikpọñ ufọk Abasi ñnyịn.”<verse eid="NEH 10:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="NEH 11" />
  <para style="s1">Mme Ufa Andidʌñ ke Yeruselem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 11:1" />Ndin mme adadusʌñ ke abio ekedʌñọ ke Yeruselem. Mbon abio se ikisʌhọ emaesịn afia adisio keed ke atu awo duob akedʌñ ke Yeruselem, adisana abio, ke ini usʌkkeed ako ekedʌññọ ke mme abio ammọ. <verse eid="NEH 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 11:2" />Mbon ado emaekọọm afịd mbon se ikinyịmme edidʌñ ke Yeruselem.<verse eid="NEH 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 11:3" />Mme adadusʌñ ekedʌññọ ke mme ikpeghe Yeruselem edo ami (usʌk nditọ Isrel, mme aku, mme Lifai, mme anamutom ke tembịd ye nditọnditọ ufọk Sọlọmọn ekedʌñọ ke mme abio Yuda, ekedʌñọ anie ufọk ammọ anie ke mme nsio-nsio abio, <verse eid="NEH 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 11:4" />ke ini mbon mfen e-eketooho Yuda ye Benyamin ekedʌññọ ke Yeruselem):</para>
  <para style="b" vid="NEH 11:4" />
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 11:4">Ubon Yuda:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NEH 11:4">Ataiya ayịn Usaiya, ayịn Sakaraiya, ayịn Amaria, ayịn Sefatia, ayịn Mahalalel, ayịn Peres;<verse eid="NEH 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 11:5" />ye Maaseiya ayịn Baruk, ayịn Kol-Hose, ayịn Hasaiya, ayịn Adaiya, ayịn Yoiyarịb, ayịn Sakaraiya, ayịn Sela.<verse eid="NEH 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 11:6" />Ubon Peres se ikidʌñ ke Yeruselem ekedo mbon uko ikie inaañ mme ata mme itiaita (468).<verse eid="NEH 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 11:7" />Ke ubon Benyamin:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NEH 11:7">Salu ayịn Mesulam, ayịn Yoed, ayịn Pedaiya, ayịn Kolaiya, ayịn Maaseiya, ayịn Itiel, ayịn Yesaiya, <verse eid="NEH 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 11:8" />ye mme andikeene anye, Kabai ye Salai, awo ikie usʌkkeed mme edịb mme itiaita (928).<verse eid="NEH 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 11:9" />Yuel ayịn Sikri akedo etubom ammọ, ndin Yuda ayịn Hasenua akese ñkpọ abaña Ufa Efaak ke abio.<verse eid="NEH 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 11:10" />Ake mme aku:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NEH 11:10">Yedaiya; ayịn Yoiyarịb; Yakịn;<verse eid="NEH 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 11:11" />Seraiya ayịn Hilkia, ayịn Mesulam, ayịn Sadọk, ayịn Meraiyọd, ayịn Ahitub, etubom andise ñkpọ mbaña ufọk Abasi, <verse eid="NEH 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 11:12" />ye mme nsaña ammọ, e-ekenamma utom tembịd, awo ikie itiaita mme edịb mme iba (822);</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NEH 11:12">Adaiya ayịn Yeroham, ayịn Pelalia, ayịn Amsi, ayịn Sakaraiya, ayịn Pasọ, ayịn Malkiya, <verse eid="NEH 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 11:13" />ye mme nsaña amọ, e-ekedooho mme mbọọñ ufọk, awo ikie iba mme aba mme iba (242);</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NEH 11:13">Amasai ayịn Asarel, ayịn Asai, ayịn Mesilemod, ayịn Imma, <verse eid="NEH 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 11:14" />ye mme nsaña amọ, e-ekedooho mbon uko, awo ikie keed mme edịb mme itiaita (128).</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NEH 11:14">Etubom ammọ akedo Sabdiel ayịn Hakedolim.<verse eid="NEH 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 11:15" />Ke mme Lifai:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NEH 11:15">Semaiya ayịn Hasub, ayịn Asrikam, ayịn Hasabaiya, ayịn Buni;<verse eid="NEH 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 11:16" />Sabetai ye Yoosabad, mme etubom Lifai iba, e-ekeseeghe ñkpọ ebaña utom anwa ke ufọk Abasi;<verse eid="NEH 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 11:17" />Matania ayịn Mika, ayịn Sabdi, ayịn Asaf, anye a-akedatta usʌñ ke ekọọm ye akam;</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NEH 11:17">Bakbukia, udiana ke atu mme nsaña amọ;</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NEH 11:17">ye Abda ayịn Samua, ayịn Kalal, ayịn Yedutun.<verse eid="NEH 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 11:18" />Mme Lifai ke adisana abio ekedo ikie iba mme anaañ mme inaañ (284).<verse eid="NEH 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 11:19" />Mme akpeme inuaatob:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NEH 11:19">Akub, Talmọn ye mme nsaña ammọ, ekekpemeke mme inuaatob, awo ikie keed mme ata mme duob mme iba (172).<verse eid="NEH 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 11:20" />Nditọ Isrel mbon ako, ye mme aku ye mme Lifai, emaeba ke afịd mme abio Yuda, ammọ keedekeed ekeba ke udeeme isọñ ammọ.<verse eid="NEH 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 11:21" />Mme anamutom ke tembịd ekedʌñ ke abod Ofel, ndin Siha ye Kispa ekese ñkpọ ebaña ammọ.<verse eid="NEH 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 11:22" />Etubom mme Lifai ke Yeruselem akedo Usi ayịn Bani, ayịn Hasabaiya, ayịn Matania, ayịn Mika. Usi akedo keed ke atu nditọ Asaf, e-ekedooho mme akwọikwọ se isisaña utom ke ufọk Abasi. <verse eid="NEH 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 11:23" />Mme akwọikwọ ekeba ke idak ndadusʌñ adidem, a-aketemmeke ammọ se enie edinam afịd usen.<verse eid="NEH 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 11:24" />Petahia ayịn Mesesabel, keed ke atu ubon Seera ayịn Yuda, akedo isʌñutom adidem ke afịd ñkpọ se ibaña mbon awo.<verse eid="NEH 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 11:25" />Amaado mme esịd idʌñ ye mme inwañ ammọ, ubaak mbon Yuda ekedʌñ ke Kiriad Aba ye mme esịd idʌñ amọ, ke Dibon ye mme esịd idʌñ, ke Yekabseel ye mme esịd idʌñ amọ, <verse eid="NEH 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 11:26" />ke Yesua, ke Molada, ke Bed Peled, <verse eid="NEH 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 11:27" />ke Hasa Sual, ke Beeseba ye mme esịd idʌñ amọ, <verse eid="NEH 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 11:28" />ke Siklak, ke Mekona ye mme esịd idʌñ amọ, <verse eid="NEH 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 11:29" />ke En Rimọn, ke Sora, ke Yamuud, <verse eid="NEH 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 11:30" />Sanoa, Adulam ye mme esịd idʌñ ammọ, ke Lakis ye mme inwañ amọ, ye ke Aseka ye mme esịd idʌñ amọ. Ntom ke ammọ ekedʌñ tọọñọ ke Beeseba tutu awuọ Abedeñ Hinọm.<verse eid="NEH 11:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 11:31" />Nditọ Benyamin e-eketooho Keba ekedʌñ ke Mikmas, Ayaa, Beteel ye mme esịd idʌñ amọ, <verse eid="NEH 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NEH 11:32" />ke Anatod, Nọb ye Anania, <verse eid="NEH 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NEH 11:33" />ke Hasọ, Rama ye Kitaim, <verse eid="NEH 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NEH 11:34" />ke Hadid, Seboim ye Nebalad, <verse eid="NEH 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NEH 11:35" />ke Lod ye Ọnọ, ye ke Kee Harasim.<verse eid="NEH 11:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NEH 11:36" />Usʌk mme Lifai ake Yuda ekedʌñọ ke Benyamin.<verse eid="NEH 11:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="NEH 12" />
  <para style="s1">Mme Aku ye Mme Lifai</para>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 12:1" />Mme aku ye mme Lifai e-eketooho edi ye Serubabel ayịn Sieltiel ye Yọsua edoñño ami:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="NEH 12:1" />
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 12:1">Seraiya, Yerimaiya, Esra,<verse eid="NEH 12:1" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 12:2" />Amaria, Maluk, Hatus,<verse eid="NEH 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 12:3" />Sekanaiya, Rehum, Meremọd,<verse eid="NEH 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 12:4" />Iddo, Kinetọn, Abiya,<verse eid="NEH 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 12:5" />Miyamịn, Madia, Bilka,<verse eid="NEH 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 12:6" />Semaiya, Yoiyarịb, Yedaiya,<verse eid="NEH 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 12:7" />Salu, Amok, Hilkia ye Yedaiya.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="NEH 12:7" />
  <para style="li4" vid="NEH 12:7">Mbon ami ekedo mme etubom mme aku ye mme nsaña ammọ ke ayio Yọsua.<verse eid="NEH 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 12:8" />Mme Lifai ekedoñño Yesua, Binui, Kadmiel, Serebia, Yuda, ye Matania ñko, anye ye mme nsaña amọ ekese ñkpọ ebaña ikwọ ekọọm. <verse eid="NEH 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 12:9" />Bakbukia ye Unni, ye mme nsaña ammọ, ekeda esak iso ese ammọ ke itie ukpeme.<verse eid="NEH 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 12:10" />Yọsua akedo ete Yoiyakịm,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 12:10">Yoiyakịm ado ete Eliasịb,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 12:10">Eliasịb ado ete Yoiyada,<verse eid="NEH 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 12:11" />Yoiyada ado ete Yọnatan,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 12:11">ndin Yọnatan ado ete Yadua.<verse eid="NEH 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 12:12" />Ke ayio Yoiyakịm, mbon e-ekedooho mbọọñ ubon mme aku edo ami:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="NEH 12:12" />
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 12:12">ake ubon Seraiya, Meraiya;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 12:12">ake Yerimaiya, Hananaiya;<verse eid="NEH 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 12:13" />ake Esra, Mesulam;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 12:13">ake Amaria, Yehohanan;<verse eid="NEH 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 12:14" />ake Maluk Yọnatan;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 12:14">ake Sekanaiya, Yosef;<verse eid="NEH 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 12:15" />ake Harim, Adna;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 12:15">ake Meremọd, Helkai;<verse eid="NEH 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 12:16" />ake Iddo, Sakaraiya;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 12:16">ake Kinetọn, Mesulam;<verse eid="NEH 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 12:17" />ake Abiya, Sikri;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 12:17">ake Miniamịn ye ake Moadia, Paltiel;<verse eid="NEH 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 12:18" />ake Bilka, Samua;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 12:18">ake Semaiya, Yehọnatan;<verse eid="NEH 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 12:19" />ake Yoiyarịb, Matenai;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 12:19">ake Yedaiya, Usi;<verse eid="NEH 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 12:20" />ake Salu, Kalai;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 12:20">ake Amok, Ebee;<verse eid="NEH 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 12:21" />ake Hilkia, Hasabaiya;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 12:21">ake Yedaiya, Netanel.<verse eid="NEH 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 12:22" />Mme mbọọñ ufọk mme Lifai ke ayio Eliasịb, Yoiyada, Yohanan ye Yadua, ye ake mme aku, emaewet esịn ke ñwed ke ini ukara Dariọs awo Pesia. <verse eid="NEH 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 12:23" />Ekewet mme mbọọñ ufọk ke atu nditọ Lifai tutu akewuọ ini Yohanan ayịn Eliasịb esịn ke ñwed mbʌk usen edem. <verse eid="NEH 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 12:24" />Ndin mme etubom mme Lifai ekedo Hasabaiya, Serebia, Yesua ayịn Kadmiel, ye mme nsaña ammọ, ake ekedaaha esak iso ese ammọ adinọ itooro ye ekọọm, ñkañ keed emaekwọ ñkañ keed ebọọrọ, naña Defid awo Abasi aketemme.<verse eid="NEH 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 12:25" />Matania, Bakbukia, Obadaiya, Mesulam, Talmọn ye Akub ekedo mme akpeme inuaatob ake ekekpemeke mme ufọk ubonoñkpọ ke inuaatob. <verse eid="NEH 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 12:26" />Ammọ ekenam utom ke ayio Yoiyakịm ayịn Yọsua, ayịn Yosadak, ye ke ayio Nehimaiya adaukara ye Esra aku, andikpeeb Mbed.<verse eid="NEH 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Udiọñ Ndibene Yeruselem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 12:27" />Ke ini udiọñ ndibene Yeruselem, emaeyem mme Lifai ke nte ammọ ekedʌñọ enyʌñ eben ammọ edi Yeruselem nọ edidia usọrọ udiọñ ndibene ke idaara ye mme ikwọ ekọọm ye ñkukwak ke mme simbal, mme ekpa ye mme ndidoudʌk. <verse eid="NEH 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 12:28" />Emaenyʌñ ekoono mme akwọikwọ eto ñkanñkʌk Yeruselem edi, eto mme esịd idʌñ mbon Netofa, <verse eid="NEH 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 12:29" />ke Bed-Kilkal, ye ke ñkañ Keba ye Asmafed, sia ammọ mbon ikwọ emaebọp ntək idʌñ ekanna Yeruselem ekʌk. <verse eid="NEH 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 12:30" />Ke ini mme aku ye mme Lifai emaekenam idem ammọ esana, ammọ emaenam mbon awo esana, enyʌñ enam mme inuaatob ye ndibene esana.<verse eid="NEH 12:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 12:31" />Ami mmaanam mme adadusʌñ ke Yuda edọọk anyọñ ndibene. Mmaanyʌñ nnịm ikpọ ñka ikwọ iba adinọ ekọọm. Keed akena nte adọọk anyọñ ndibene ke ubọk nnasia, ke ubeñ Inuaatob Ifịm. <verse eid="NEH 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NEH 12:32" />Hosaiya ye ubaak mme adadusʌñ ke Yuda emaekeene ammọ, <verse eid="NEH 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NEH 12:33" />ye Asaria, Esra, Mesulam, <verse eid="NEH 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NEH 12:34" />Yuda, Benyamin, Semaiya, Yerimaiya, <verse eid="NEH 12:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NEH 12:35" />ye usʌk mme aku ekekamake adukpoñ, ye Sakaraiya ayịn Yọnatan, ayịn Semaiya, ayịn Matania, ayịn Maikaiya, ayịn Saku ayịn Asaf, <verse eid="NEH 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NEH 12:36" />ye mme nsaña amọ: Semaiya, Asarel, Milalai, Kilalai, Maai, Netanel, Yuda ye Hanani, ekama mme ñkpọ ikwọ naña Defid awo Abasi aketemme. Esra andikpeeb Mbed akeda iso udịm ado. <verse eid="NEH 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NEH 12:37" />Ke Inuaatob Idịm Mmọọñ ammọ emaekaa iso edọọk udodukod Abio Defid ke itie ake ndibene adọọhọ enyʌñ esaña anyọñ-anyọñ itie ufọk Defid ekewuọ Inuaatob Mmọọñ ke edem usakkautịn.<verse eid="NEH 12:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NEH 12:38" />Ayọhọ ñka ikwọ iba ekedʌk nsakiso. Ami mmaakeene ammọ ndọọk anyọñ ndibene, nsaña ye mbakka iba mbon awo, ibọhọ Tọwa mme Ofen ikiwuọ Ñnwaña Ndibene, <verse eid="NEH 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NEH 12:39" />ikaaña Inuaatob Ifrem, Inuaatob Yesana, Inuaatob Iyak, Tọwa Hananel ye Tọwa Ikie, tutu akewuọ Inuaatob Edọñ. Ammọ emaeketuak eda ke Inuaatob Ukpeme.<verse eid="NEH 12:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="NEH 12:40" />Mme ñka ikwọ iba ado ekenọọhọ ekọọm emaedat itie ammọ ndin ke ufọk Abasi; ami ñko mmaanam ntoro, dian ye ubaak mme adaaha, <verse eid="NEH 12:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NEH 12:41" />ye mme aku ñko, Eliakịm, Maaseiya, Miniamịn, Maikaiya, Elioenai, Sakaraiya ye Hananaiya, ekama adukpoñ ammọ, <verse eid="NEH 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="NEH 12:42" />ye Maaseiya, Semaiya, Eliasa, Usi, Yehohanan, Malkiya, Elam ye Esaa. Mme ñka ikwọ ado ekekwọ ikwọ ke ndadusʌñ Yesrahaiya. <verse eid="NEH 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NEH 12:43" />Ndin usen ado ammọ emaewa ikpọ uwa, edaara sia Abasi amaanọ ammọ akwa idaara. Mme ibaan ye ntəkayịn emaenyʌñ edaara. Emaetie ke anyan usʌñ ekop ñkpo idaara ke Yeruselem.<verse eid="NEH 12:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="NEH 12:44" />Ke ini ado emaesio mme awo edise ñkpọ ebaña mme ubeed ubono mme enọ ake etịbe, akpa mfịd ye keed ke itie duob. Akena nte ammọ ekoono udeeme mme aku ye ake mme Lifai ke mme inwañ ke mme abio edidọñ ke mme ubeed ubonoñkpọ ado naña Mbed aketañ, sia Yuda amaanem esịd ye mme aku ye mme Lifai ekesañake utom do. <verse eid="NEH 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NEH 12:45" />Ammọ emaenam utom Abasi ammọ ye utom adinam asana, mme akwọikwọ ye mme akpeme inuaatob emaenyʌñ enam ñko, kpa naña Defid ye ayịn amọ awodeen Sọlọmọn eketemme. <verse eid="NEH 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NEH 12:46" />Ke anyan ini ko-o, ke ayio Defid ye ake Asaf, emaesinie mme adadusʌñ enọ mme akwọikwọ enyʌñ enie enọ mme ikwọ itooro ye ekọọm Abasi. <verse eid="NEH 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NEH 12:47" />Ke ntoro ke ayio Serubabel ye ake Nehimaiya, afịd Isrel emaetịp ndidia se ikem ke usen ke usen se enọ mme akwọikwọ ye mme akpeme inuaatob. Ammọ emaenyʌñ enịm udeeme mme Lifai mbon ako, ndin mme Lifai emaenịm enọ nditọ Erọn.<verse eid="NEH 12:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="NEH 13" />
  <para style="s1">Nehimaiya Anam Akpatre Uneeñe Ñkpọ Mbono</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 13:1" />Ke usen ado emaekoot Ñwed Moses ke akpọsọñ uyio nọ mme awo ekop ndin do ke ekekịt nte ewet ebo ke inaaha eyak awo Amọn me awo Mọb ndomokeed adʌk esob Abasi tutu amama, <verse eid="NEH 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 13:2" />sia ammọ ikiinọọhọ nditọ Isrel ye ndidia ye mmọọñ ado ekekpe Balaam ebo akoot isuuñọ anọ ammọ. (Ado Abasi ñnyịn amaanam isuuñọ ado akappa ado adidiọñ.) <verse eid="NEH 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 13:3" />Ke ini atu awo ekekoppo mbed ami, ammọ emaediañña afịd awo se ikido asen esio ke Isrel.<verse eid="NEH 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 13:4" />Mbemiso idaha ado, emaenịm Eliasịb aku ase ñkpọ abaña mme ubeed ubonoñkpọ ke ufọk Abasi ñnyịn. Anye amaakpere Tobia idem, <verse eid="NEH 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 13:5" />ndin amaanọ anye ekamba ubeed keed ekesidọññọ ñkpasi uwa ye insensi ye mme ñkpoduoho tembịd, ye mme keed ke itie duob ke ñkpasi, ufa ukọd ye adan ọlif eketemmeke ebo enọ mme Lifai, mme akwọikwọ ye mme akpeme inuaatob, ñkọrọ ye etịbe mme aku.<verse eid="NEH 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 13:6" />Ado naña afịd ñkpọ ami akekaaha iso, ami ñkebaaha ke Yeruselem, sia ke ayọhọ isua edịb mme duob mme iba ke ukara adidem Ataseeses ake Babilọn ami mmaatịmme mbịne adidem. Akema ami mmaabeeñe <verse eid="NEH 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 13:7" />ñnyʌñ ntịmme ndi Yeruselem. Mi ke ami ñkedidiọọñọ mbaña idiọọkñkpọ se Eliasịb akenam ke adinọ Tobia ubeed ke akwere ufọk Abasi. <verse eid="NEH 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 13:8" />Ami mmaayat esịd eti-eti ndin mmaasịññe afịd ñkpoduoho ufọk Tobia ke ubeed ado ntoomo nduọñọ. <verse eid="NEH 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 13:9" />Ami mmaanọ uyio nte enam mme ubeed ado esana, ndin mmaamaana ntañ mme ñkpoduoho ufọk Abasi, ye mme uwa ñkpasi ye insensi ndọñ ke esịd ammọ.<verse eid="NEH 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 13:10" />Ami mmaanyʌñ ndidiọọñọ ke awo ikinọọhọ mme Lifai udeeme ndidia ammọ, ndin ke afịd mme Lifai ye mme akwọikwọ se isinam utom emaetịmme enyọñọ inwañ ammọ. <verse eid="NEH 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 13:11" />Ndin ami mmaasua nnọ mme adaaha ñnyʌñ mbịp ammọ nte, “Nsoo inam nọ etre adise ñkpọ mbaña ufọk Abasi?” Ndin mmaakoot ammọ mbok itie keed ñnyʌñ mbon ammọ ke itie utom ammọ.<verse eid="NEH 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 13:12" />Afịd Yuda emaeben keed ke itie duob ke ñkpasi, ufa ukọd ye adan ọlif edisịn ke mme ubeed ubono ñkpọ. <verse eid="NEH 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 13:13" />Ami mmaaben aku Selemia, Sadọk awedñwed, ye Lifai keed a-akekereke Pedaiya nnịm nọ ese ñkpọ ebaña mme ubeed ubono ñkpọ ñnyʌñ nnam Hanan ayịn Saku, ayịn Matania, anwam ammọ, sia ekekịt ammọ nte mbon akpanikọ. Utom ammọ akedo adideeme ñkpọ se iba nnọọ mme Lifai ammọ.<verse eid="NEH 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 13:14" />Abasi mmi, ntoiyo miin ke abaña ñkpọ ami, kuunyʌñ usọọk se ami ñkenam ke esịd akpanikọ ye ñwaidem nnọ ufọk Abasi mmi ye mme utom amọ usio.<verse eid="NEH 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 13:15" />Ke mme usen ado ami mmaakịt mme awo ke Yuda nte enuakka mmịn ke ukwak unam ukọd ke Sabad enyʌñ ekoono abakpa edoot ke edem mme dọñki, ebiom ukọd ñko, ye kreb, ye fik ye afịd utọ mbiomo. Ndin ammọ ekesʌk ekoono afịd mme ñkpọ ami edʌk Yeruselem ke Sabad. Anam ami mmaasua nnọ ammọ adinyam ndidia ke usen ado. <verse eid="NEH 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 13:16" />Mbon Tai se ikidʌñọ ke Yeruselem emaeben iyak ye utọ ke utọ ñkpọ udua edinyam ke Yeruselem ke usen Sabad enọ mbon Yuda. <verse eid="NEH 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 13:17" />Mmaatọhọ ye mme mbọọñ Yuda ñnyʌñ mbo ammọ nte, “Nsoo utọ ndoom ke ndufo enam ami edisappa usen Sabad? <verse eid="NEH 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 13:18" />Nte mme eteete ndufo ikinamma mme ukem ñkpọ ami, anam Abasi ñnyịn aben afịd ukuud ami ikeene ñnyịn ye abio ami? Idahami ndufo emenekke edat iyadesịd edot Isrel ke adisappa usen Sabad.”<verse eid="NEH 13:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 13:19" />Ke ini ndukpọñ ndubiayio amaaketọọñọ adifʌk inuaatob Yeruselem mbemiso Sabad, ami mmaanọ uyio nte ekọp usʌñ ke enyʌñ ebeere tutu Sabad akweeñe. Ami mmaadaaha usʌk mbon mmi ke mme inuaatob mbaak ediben mbiomo edʌk ke usen Sabad. <verse eid="NEH 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 13:20" />Akañ keed me akañ iba mme ikpọ anyam udua ye mbon se inyam utọ ke utọ ñkpọ udua emaenaa ke edem Yeruselem. <verse eid="NEH 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 13:21" />Ado ami mmaasua nnọ ammọ mbo nte, “Nsoo inam ndufo enaa ke mben ndibene? Ndufo ekpemaana enam ñkpọ ami, ñyaimʌm ndufo.” Tọọñọ ado ammọ ikidiighe aba ke usen Sabad. <verse eid="NEH 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 13:22" />Ndin ami mmaabo mme Lifai nte enam idem ammọ esana enyʌñ ekekpeme mme inuaatob mbaak enịm usen Sabad ke adisana.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="NEH 13:22" />
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 13:22">Ntoiyo miin ke abaña ami ñko, Abasi mmi, nyʌñ ntua miin mbọm ke akwa ima mfo.<verse eid="NEH 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 13:23" />Ke ado aboiyoke, ke ini ado ami mmaakịt mbon Yuda nte ekedọi ibaan Asdọd, Amọn ye Mọb. <verse eid="NEH 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 13:24" />Usʌk nditọ ammọ ekesem usem Asdọd me usem idịd mfen, ndin idiọọñọke adisem usem Yuda. <verse eid="NEH 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 13:25" />Ami mmaatọhọ ye ammọ ñnyʌñ ñkoot isuuñọ nnọ ammọ. Mmaamia usʌk ideen ñnyʌñ ñwịppe ammọ ided ke iwuod nsio. Mmaanam ammọ edat unwọñọ ke anyịñ Abasi ñnyʌñ mbo ammọ nte: “Inaaha eben nditọ ibaan ndufo enọ nditọ ideen ammọ ke ndọ, inyʌññọ ina edọ nditọ ibaan ammọ enọ nditọ ideen ndufo me edọ enọ idem ndufo. <verse eid="NEH 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 13:26" />Nte ikidooho ke ntak mme ndọ ntom ke Sọlọmọn adidem Isrel akenam idiọọkñkpọ? Ibaaha adidem ndomokeed akebitte anye ke atu uwak idịd ado. Abasi amọ amaama anye, ndin Abasi amaanam anye ado adidem ke afịd Isrel, ado mme ibaan asen idịd emaenam anye adue Abasi. <verse eid="NEH 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 13:27" />Nte ana ñnyịn ikop idahami ke ndufo ñko esʌk enam afịd utọ ibak ami e-enyʌñ enam idiọọk ido ke iso Abasi ñnyịn ke adidọ ibaan asenidịd?”<verse eid="NEH 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 13:28" />Keed ke atu nditọ Yoiyada ayịn Eliasịb ekamba aku akedo ebe ayịn Sanbalad awo Họrọn. Ndin ami mmaabịn anye nsio.<verse eid="NEH 13:28" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 13:29" />Toiyo ammọ, Abasi mmi, sia ammọ emaesappa itie aku ye edioomo itie aku ye ake mme Lifai.<verse eid="NEH 13:29" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 13:30" />Ntom ke ami ñkesịññe afịd asen ñkpọ mfep ke itie mme aku ye mme Lifai, ñnyʌñ nnam ammọ esana, ñnyʌñ nnọ ammọ keedekeed iso utom ammọ. <verse eid="NEH 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 13:31" />Ami mmaanyʌñ nnam ndutʌm ke abaña enọ ifia ke ini ekedotto, ye ke abaña mme akpa mfịd.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="NEH 13:31" />
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 13:31">Ntoiyo miin ke mfọn, Abasi mmi.<verse eid="NEH 13:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 13" />
</usx>